<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">1 Samuela</book>
  <para style="h">1 Samuela</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Samuela</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samuela</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Samuela</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Efraim tlângrama Ramathaim-zofim khuaah mi pakhat a awm a, a hming chu Elkana a ni. Chu mi chu Jehorama fapa a ni a, Jehorama chu Elihua fapa a ni. Elihua chu Tohua fapa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nupui pahnih a nei a, pakhat hming chu Hani a ni a, pakhat hming chu Penini a ni. Penini chuan fate a nei a, Hani erawh chuan fa a nei ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu mi chu Engkim Lalpa chibai bûk tûr leh a hnêna thilhlan hlân tûrin kum tin a awmna khua aṭang chuan Silo khuaah a chho ṭhîn. Chutah chuan Elia fapa pahnih, Hofnia leh Finehasa, Lalpa puithiamte chu an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Elkanan thilhlan a hlan ni chuan a fapa te, a fanu te tân chanvo a siamsak ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hani chu hmangaih hle mah se, Lalpa chuan fa nei thei lova a siam avângin chan khat chauh a siamsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Fa a neih theih loh avânga a lungngaihna tizual tûrin amah ertu Penini chuan a deusawh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutianga kum tin Lalpa ina an kal ṭhin lai chuan a ertunu chuan a tilungngai hle ṭhîn a ni. Chuvâng chuan, a ṭap a ṭap a, chaw pawh a ei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A pasal Elkana chuan, “Hani, engtizia nge chaw i ei duh loh? Engati nge i rilru a nat le? Fapa sâwm aiin i tân ka hlu zâwk lo em ni?” a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vawi khat chu Silo khuaa an eia an in zawhin Hani chu a tho va. Chutih lai chuan puithiam Elia chu Lalpa in kawngka ban bul ṭhutthlêngah a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hani chu lungchhe taka ṭap chungin Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hetiang hian thu a tiam ta a, “Aw Engkim Lalpa , i bawihnu chan chhiatzia hi min hriatsak a, i bawihnu hi thlahthlam lova fapa min pêk chuan a dam chhûng zawng Lalpa ka pe ang a, a lu pawh meh a ni rêng rêng lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutianga Lalpa hnêna a ṭawngṭai lai chuan a hmui phun chu Elia chuan a lo en reng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hani chu ṭhahnemngai takin a ṭawngṭai a, ri lovin a hmui chauh a phun a, Elia chuan zu a rui emaw a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elia chuan a hnênah, “Eng chen nge i ruih dâwn le? I uain in chu dah bo teh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hani chuan, “Ka pu, ka rui lo asin, hmeichhe lungngai tak ka nih hi, uain pawh, zupui pawh ka in rêng rêng lo; Lalpa hnênah ka rilru natna ka thlen a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I bawihnu hi hmeichhe sualah puh suh; lungngai leh mangang takin ka ṭawngṭai a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elia chuan, “Thlamuang takin kal la, a hnêna i dîl chu Israel-te Pathian chuan pe che rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chuan, “I chhiahhlawhnu hi min duhsak zêl rawh aw,” a ti a. Tichuan, Hani chu a chhuak a, chawte a ei a, lungngai hmêl a pu ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A tûkah chuan zîng takah an tho va, Lalpa hnênah an ṭawngṭai a, Rama khuaa an in lamah chuan an haw ta a. Elkana chuan a nupui Hani chu a pâwl a. Lalpa chuan ani chu a hre reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Hanin nau a pai a, fapa a hring a, “ Lalpa hnêna ka dîl chhuah a ni” tiin a hmingah Samuela a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Elkana leh a chhûngte chu Lalpa hnêna an kum tin thilhlan hlân tûr leh an thutiam hlen tûrin an chho va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hani erawh chu a kal ve lo. A pasal hnênah chuan, “Naupang hian hnute hnêk a bân hunah ani chu ka hruai ang a, Lalpa hnênah ka hlân ang a, chutah chuan a awm reng tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pasal Elkana chuan a hnênah, “Ṭha i tih ang chuan ti rawh, hnute hnêk i bântîr thlengin awm la, Lalpa chuan i tih ang chuan thlentîr rawh se,” a ti a. Hani chuan a fapain hnute hnêk a bân hma chuan inah a awmpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hnute hnêk a bântîr hnu chuan a fapa chu a hruai a, chhangphut kg. sâwm leh uain bûr khat a keng a, bâwngpa kum thuma upa kaiin Silo khuaa Lalpa inah chuan a kal ta a, a fa chu a la naupang hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bâwngpa chu an talh a, naupang chu Elia hnênah chuan an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Aw ka pu, nangmah ngeiin i hria a; ih e, ka pu, kei hi he laia i hmaa Lalpa hnêna ṭawngṭai hmeichhia kha ka ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />He naupang dîl hian ka ṭawngṭai a; tichuan, Lalpan ka dîl chu min pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuvângin, ani chu Lalpa hnênah ka hlân a ni. A dam chhûng zawng Lalpa tâna hlan a ni,” a ti a. Chutah chuan Lalpa hmaah an kûn ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hani chu hetiang hian a ṭawngṭai a: Lalpa chungah ka va lâwm êm! Thil ropui tak mi tihsak ta si a. Ka hmêlmate laka uanna tûr ka nei ta, A chhandamnaah chuan ka lâwm êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa anga thianghlim an awm lo, Nangmah ang rêng an awm si lo, Kan Pathian ang hi humhimtu dang an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chapo takin ṭawng mai mai suh la, Chaltlai takin thu sawi suh. Lalpa chu engkim hretu Pathian a ni, Ani chuan mi tin thiltih a bûk fel ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi chakte thalngul a titliak a, Mi chak lote a tichak thar leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlai taka awm ṭhînte chu ei tûr zawngin an inhlawhfa a, Rilṭâm taka awm ṭhînte chu tlai takin an awm ta. Chingin fa pasarih a nei a, Fa tam tak hringtu chu khawharin a awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a tihlum ṭhîn a, a tinung bawk ṭhîn. Thlânah a chhuktîr a, a hruai chhuak bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a tipachhia a, a tihausa ṭhîn; A titlâwm a, a chawisâng bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Retheite chu vaivut ata a kaitho va, Pachhiate chu êkdûr ata a chawikâng ṭhîn. Anni chu milian zîngah a teltîr a, Chawimawina lalṭhutthlêng a chantîr ta. Leilung nghahchhan chu Lalpa ta a ni a; A chungah khawvêl hi a nghat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A mi thianghlimte ke chu a vêng ang a, Mi sualte erawh chu thim zîngah an boral ang. Tu mah, an chak avângin an dingchang lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa dotute chu an thlabâr ang a, Vân aṭangin khawpui riin a do vang a, A ruat, lal chu a tichak ang a, A hriakthiha chu a chawimawi ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Elkana chu Rama khuaa a inah a haw ta a, naupang erawh chu Lalpa rawng bâwlin puithiam Elia hnênah chuan a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elia fapate chu an sual hle a, Lalpa pawh an pawisa lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mipui laka puithiamte awm dân tûr angin an awm lo va. Thil hlân tûra mi an lo kalte hian an chhiahhlawhte chu thîrkut kengin an lo kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />bêl rawng zau emaw, bêl dâwt nei emaw, bêl khaina nei emaw, bêl pangngai emaw chhûng chu an zu chhun a, sa thurna thîrkuta an lâk chhuah apiang chu puithiamin a nei ṭhîn a. Chutiang chuan Israel mi Silo khuaa lo kal zawng zawngte chu an lo tihsak ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu chauh a ni lo, a thau chu an hâl hmain chhiahhlawhte chu an lo kal a, inthawina hlântu hnênah chuan, “Puithiam tâna hem hmin tûr sa min pe rawh, i sa chhum hminsa a duh lo, a hel a ni a duh ni,” an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Inthawina hlântu chuan a hnênah, “A thau chu hâl phawt sela, chumi hnuah i duh zât zât la ang che,” an lo tih pawhin, “Ni lo, min pe nghâl rawh, min pêk loh chuan ka la lui rêng rêng dâwn,” an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa hnêna thilhlan chu miten an lo ngainêp ta hle a; chuvângin, tlangvâlte sualna chu Lalpa mit hmuhah a huatthlala êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Samuela chu la naupang hle mah se, puithiam kawr, puan zaisîna siam hâ-in Lalpa rawng a bâwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kum tinin a nuin kawrfual a ṭhuisak a; kum tin a pasal nên thil hlân tûra an kal apiangin a kensak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Elia chuan Elkana leh a nupui chu mal a sâwm a, “ Lalpa tâna fa in hlan rulh nân he hmeichhia hi fa dang pe rawh se,” a ti a; tichuan, an in lamah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hmeichhia chu a kan a; tichuan, nau a pai leh a, fapa pathum leh fanu pahnih a hring ta a. Tin, naupang Samuela chu Lalpa kiangah chuan a seilian ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Elia chu a lo tar ta hle a; a fapaten Israel mite chunga an thil sual tih zawng zawng leh Inbiakna bûk kawngka bula rawngbâwltu hmeichhiate an lo mutpui ṭhin thute chu a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, an hnênah, “Engati nge hetiang thil hi in tih le? Hêng thil ṭha lo in tih hi mi tinin min hrilh asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka fate u, ti tawh rêng rêng suh u, Lalpa mite zînga thuthang ka hriat hi thil ṭha lo tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi pakhat mi dang chunga a sual chuan Pathianin a sawipui ṭhîn; amaherawhchu, Lalpa chunga mi a sual chuan tu nge hum ta ang le?” a ti a. Chuti chung pawhin an pa thu chu an awih duh chuang lo va; chuvangin, Lalpa chuan anni chu tihhlum a tum ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, naupang Samuela chu a lo ṭhang lian deuh deuh va; Lalpa leh mihringte duhsak a hlawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Elia hnênah chuan Pathian mi, mi pakhat a lo kal a, a hnênah, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, “Aigupta rama Farawa bawiha an awm lai khân in pate hnênah ka inlâr a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Arona chu Israel hnam zawng zawng zîng ata ka maichâma kala, rimtui hâla, puithiam kawr haa ka hmaa puithiam ni tûrin ka ruat a ni lâwm ni? Tin, i pute chu Israel mite hâlral thilhlan zawng zawng ka pe a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka hnêna inthawina leh ka tâna thilhlan, ka chanpual atâna ka ruat chu engati nge in hmuhsit le? Engati nge kei aia i fate i dah pawimawha mahni intihthau nâna ka mi Israel-te inthawina, a ṭha ṭha in ît le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />I chhûngte leh i pa chhûngte chuan kumkhuain ka hmaah rawng an bâwl ang, tiin ka lo tiam tawh na a; tûnah, Lalpa thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti; ‘In bâwl tawp lo vang, mi chawimawi apiang ka chawimawi ang a, mi hmusittu chu ka hmusit ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngai teh, i chakna te, i pa chhûngte chakna te ka tihchhiat ni chu a lo thleng dâwn ta; in chhûng zîngah tarkûna dam rêng in awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel mi dangte mal ka sâwmna chu i hmuhin i awt ang a, i thîk ang, i fate tu mah tarkûna dam an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, i thlah, ka maichâma rawngbâwl tûra ka zuah chhun chu i mit tikhamtu leh i rilru tinatu mai a ni ang; i thlah i ina lo piang dang zawng zawng chu an vânglai takin an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hei hi i tâna chhinchhiahna lo thleng tûr chu a ni: I fapate pahnih Hofnia leh Finehasa hi ni khatah an thi dûn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka tân puithiam rinawm tak ka din thar leh ang a, chu chuan ka duhzâwng takin thil a ti ang. An chhûngkua nghet takin ka din ang a, ka hriakthiha hmaah chuan rawng a bâwl reng ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, i thlah la dam chhunte chu a hmaah chuan chhang nawi leh pawisa dîlin an kûn ang a, ‘Ei tûr kan hmuh theih nân puithiam hna eng emaw tal min thawhtîr ta che,’ an ti ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Naupang Samuela chuan Elia kaihhruaiin Lalpa rawng a bâwl a. Chûng lai chuan Lalpa thu a thleng khât hle a, inlârna pawh a thleng zen zen lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Elia mit chu a chak tawh lo va, khua pawh a hmu ṭha tawh lo va, a dân pangngaiin a mut hmunah chuan a mu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samuela chu Lalpa in, Thuthlung Bâwm hûnna bulah chuan a mu a. Khua a vâra, khâwnvâr an tihmih hmain,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Samuela chu a ko va. Samuela chuan, “Eng nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Elia hnênah chuan a kal a, a hnênah, “Eng atân nge min koh?” a va ti a. Elia chuan, “Ka ko lo che, va mu leh tawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, a kal a, a va mu leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Samuela chu a ko leh a; tichuan, Samuela chu a tho va, Elia hnênah chuan a kal leh a, “Eng atân nge min koh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Samuela chuan Lalpa aw a ni tih a la hre rih lo, Lalpa aw chu a la hre ngai lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Samuela chu a ko leh a, chu chu a vawi thumna a ni. Tichuan, a tho va, Elia hnênah a kal leh a, “Eng atân nge min koh?” a ti a. Elia chuan naupang chu Lalpan a ko a ni tih a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Elia chuan Samuela hnênah chuan, “Kal la, va mu leh la, a koh leh che chuan, ‘Aw Lalpa , thu sawi rawh, i chhiahhlawh hian a ngaithla e,’ ti ang che,” a ti a. Samuela chu a kal a, a va mu leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chu a lo kal a, a ding a, a hmaa a koh ang khân, “Samuel, Samuel,” a rawn ti a. Samuela chuan, “Thu sawi rawh, i chhiahhlawh hian a ngaithla e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Samuela hnênah, “Ngai teh, Israel ramah hian a hria apiang thin tiṭhâwng zawk tûr ka thlentîr dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Elia chhûngkaw chungchânga ka lo sawi tawh chu a bul aṭanga a tâwp thlengin ka thlentîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A fapaten Pathian laka thil sual an tih hre reng chunga a khap loh avângin an chhûngkua chu ka hrem kumkhua dâwn tih ka hrilh tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, Elia chhûngkaw bawhchhiatna chu inthawinain emaw, thilhlanin emaw engtikah mah tihkian theih a ni lo vang’ tiin Elia chhûngkaw chungchâng thu ka lo tiam tawh a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuela chu zîng thlengin a mu a, Lalpa in kawngkhârte chu a hawng a, inlârna thu chu Elia hrilh a hreh hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, Elia chuan Samuela chu a ko va, “Samuel, ka fapa,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Eng nge ni, ka pu?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elia chuan, “Eng thu nge i hnênah a sawi? Ka hnênah eng mah zêp suh; i hnêna a sawi eng pawh ka laka i zêp chuan Pathianin na takin a hrem ang che,” tiin a vau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, Samuela chuan eng mah zêp lovin a hrilh ta vek a. Elia chuan a hnênah, “ Lalpa a nih chu, ṭha a tih ang zêlin ti rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Samuela chu a lo ṭhang lian deuh deuh va, a hnênah Lalpa chu a awm a, a sawi apiang a lo thleng dik zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dan aṭanga Beer-seba thlengin Israel mi zawng zawng chuan Samuela chu Lalpa zâwlnei dik tak a ni tih an lo hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Silo khuaah chuan Lalpa chu a inlâr zui zêl a. Silo-ah chuan Lalpa chu thuin Samuela hnênah a inlâr a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuela thu chu mi zawng zawngin an ngaichâng a. Israel mite chu Filistia mite do tûrin an lo chhuak a, Ebenezer-ah ṭanhmun an khuar a. Filistia mite pawhin Afek-ah ṭanhmun an khuar bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Filistia sipaite chu Israel-te bei tûrin an inzâr pharh a, an han inbei a, Filistia mite chuan Israel-te chu an hneh a, indona hmunah chuan mi sângli lai an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An ṭanhmuna sipaite an lo kîr hnu chuan Israel upate chuan, “Engtizia nge vawiinah Lalpan Filistia mite hmaah min tihtlâwm aw. Hawh u, Silo khuaa Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm kha han la ila; tichuan, kan keng zêl ang a, kan hmêlmate lakah min chhanhim dâwn nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mite chuan Silo-ah mi an tîr a, Cherub chunga ṭhu Lalpa Engkimtitheia Thuthlung Bâwm chu an va la a; chutah chuan Elia fa Hofnia leh Finehasa pawh an tel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm chu an riahhmun an rawn thlenpui veleh Israel mi zawng zawng chu lei nghawr ri dur dur khawpin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An au thâwm chu Filistia mite chuan an lo hria a, “Hebrai-ho bûkah chuan engtizia nge an au chiam mai le?” an ti a. An bûkah Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm a lo thleng a ni tih an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Filistia mite chuan an hlau va, “An riahhmunah an Pathian a lo kal ta a nih chu! Kan boral dâwn ta, tûn hmain hetiang hi a la awm ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan chung a va pik êm, chu Pathian chak tak kut ata chu tu nge min chhan chhuak ang? Chu Pathian chu a ni thlalêra Aigupta mite hri ṭha lo pui puia tihlumtu kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mahse, Filistia mite u, zâm lovin huaisen takin bei rawh u, intimipa ula, bei rawh u, in chhiahhlawha an awm ang khân Hebrai-hote chhiahhlawha in awm loh nân,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Filistia mite chuan an han bei vak a, Israel mite chu an tlâwm ta a, mi tin mahni in lamah an tlân haw ta a. Indonaah chuan Israel sipaite chu an that chiam a, sîngthum lai an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian Bâwm chu an lâksak a, Elia fa pahnih Hofnia leh Finehasa pawh chu an that bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi ni tak chuan Benjamina thlah mi pakhat indona hmun aṭang chuan a lo tlan haw a, a puan a pawtthlêr a, a luah vaivut a phul a, Silo khua a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A lo thlen chuan Elia chu kawng sîra ṭhutthlêngah a lo ṭhu a. Pathian Bâwm chu a ngaihtuah êm êm avângin a lo thlîr reng a; chu mi chuan khua a lo thlen chuan thil awmzia chu a rawn sawi a, a khuain an ṭap ta chuah chuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elia chuan an ṭap thâwm chu a lo hriatin, “Engtizia ta mur mur nge?” a ti a. Chu pa chu Elia hnênah hmanhmawh takin a lo tlân a, a hrilh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Elia chu kum sawmkua leh pariat lai a ni a, a mit a chak tawh lo va, khua pawh a hmu ṭha thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chu mi chuan Elia hnênah, “Indona hmun aṭangin ka lo haw a, vawiinah chu hmun aṭangin ka lo tlânchhia a ni,” a ti a. Elia chuan, “Ka fapa, eng angin nge thil a awm le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chanchin thar rawn thlentu chuan, “Israel mite chu Filistia-ho hmaah an tlânchhia a, mi tam tak an that bawk a. I fate pahnih Hofnia leh Finehasa pawh an thi a, Pathian Bâwm pawh an chhuhsak ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian Bâwm chanchin a sawi lai tak chuan kawngka bula a ṭhutna aṭang chuan a zangthalin a tlu a, a ring a tliak a, a thi ta a. Tar tak a ni a, a inzo tawh lo va ni. Kum sawmli chhûng Israel-te chu a kaihruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a monu, Finehasa nupui chuan nau a pai a, a hrin a hun ṭêp tawh a. Pathian Bâwm an lâksak thu te, a pasala pa leh a pasal thih thu te a han hriat chuan nau a vei a, a hring ta nghâl a, a chau hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hnuk a chat ṭêp a, nau chhartu hmeichhiate chuan, “Hlau suh, fapa i nei a nia,” an ti a; mahse, a chhâng miah lo va, a ngaihsak hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“A hmingah Ikaboda ni rawh se, Israel ropuina chu a chuai ta si a,” a ti a. Pathian Bâwm an lâksak a, a pu leh a pasal an thi ta si a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian Bâwm an lâksak avângin ‘Israel ropuina chu a chuai ta,’ a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistia miten Pathian Bâwm an lâksak hnu chuan Eben-ezer aṭangin Asdod khuaah an kalpui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Filistia mite chuan Pathian Bâwm chu Dagona biak inah an la lût a, Dagona bulah an dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tûk zînga Asdod mite an han thawh chuan, ngai teh, Dagona chu bawkkhupin Lalpa Bâwm hmaah chuan a lo tlu dêr a. Tichuan, Dagona chu an la a, a hmun ngaiah an dah leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tûk leh zînga an thawh chuan, ngai teh, Dagona chu Lalpa Bâwm hmaah chuan bawkkhupin a lo tlu leh dêr a. Dagona lu leh a kut bungte chu kawngka bulah a lo lum reng bawk a, a taksa chauh chu a lo awm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu thil avâng chuan Dagona puithiamte leh Dagona biak ina lo kal ṭhîn zawng zawng chuan Asdod khuaa Dagona biak in kawngka bul chu tûn thlengin an la rap ngam lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Asdod-a mite chu na takin a hrem a, ngâwt na chi a veitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu thil thleng chu Asdod miten an hmuh chuan, “Israel-te Pathian Bâwm chu kan hnênah awm tawh suh se, kan Pathian Dagona chungah leh kan chungah a kutthlâk a na êm mai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Filistia lal zawng zawng an ko khâwm a, “Israel-te Pathian Bâwm hi engtin nge kan tih tâk ang le?” an ti a. Anni chuan “Israel-te Pathian Bâwm hi Gath khuaah kalpui rawh u,” an ti a; tichuan, Israel-te Pathian Bâwm chu an va kalpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khua an thlenpui hnu chuan Lalpa chuan chu khua chu a hrem a, khuaa mite chu natna râpthlâk tak a tuartîr a, a tê ber aṭanga a lian ber thlengin ngâwt na chi an vei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Pathian Bâwm chu Ekron khuaah an thawn a, Pathian Bâwm a lo thlen chuan Ekron khuaa mite chuan, “Israel-te Pathian Bâwm chu keini leh kan mite tihlum tûrin an rawn la ta a nih hi,” tiin an au chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Filistia lal zawng zawng chu an ko khâwm a, “Israel-te Pathian Bâwm hi la sawn ula, keini leh kan mite min tihhlum loh nân a awmna ngaiah dah leh rawh u,” an ti a. Pathian hremna chu a nat êm avângin khaw pum pui chu an buai nuai nuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thi bangte chuan ngâwt na chi chu an vei a, chu khaw ṭap thâwm chuan vân a thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa Bâwm chu Filistia ramah chuan thla sarih a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Filistia mite chuan, puithiam te, aienthiam te an râwn a, “ Lalpa bâwm hi engtin nge kan tih dâwn le, a hmun ngaia thawn kîr leh dân tûr min hrilh rawh u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Israel-te Pathian Bâwm hi in thawn kîr a nih chuan a ruakin thawn kîr suh u, a hnênah tihsual man thilhlan hlân ngei ngei ang che u. Tichuan, tihdam in ni ang a, eng vânga a kut tuar nge in nih in hria ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mipui chuan, “Kan bawhchhiat thawi nâna a hnêna kan hlan tûr chu engte nge ni ang?” an ti a. Anni chuan, “Filistia lal zâtin ngâwt lem panga leh chaichîm lem panga rangkachakin siam rawh u; in hripui vei leh in lalte hri vei hi a thuhmun reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngâwt lem panga leh in ram tichhetu chaichîm lem panga in siamte chuan Israel-te Pathian chu chawimawi rawh u. Tichuan, nangni leh in puithiamte chu, in rante nên a hrem nêp deuh che u mahna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Farawa leh Aigupta miten an rilru an tikhauh ang khân engah nge in rilru in tihkhauh le? Na taka a sawisak hnuah Israel-te chu an chhuahtîr a, an kal ta a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tichuan, tûnah tawlailîr thar buatsaih ula, bâwngpui pahnih, a hnute sâwr lai, nghâwngkawl la bât ngai lo buatsaih bawk ula. Bâwng chu tawlailîr hnuhtîr ula, an note erawh chu in lamah hruai hawsak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa Bâwm chu la ula, tawlailîrah chuan dah rawh u. Tin, tihsual man thawina rangkachaka siam in pêkte kha bâwm dangah thun ula, Lalpa Bâwm sîrah dah ula, tawlailîr chu kaltîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />En reng ula, a awmna ram lam a pana, Beth-semes khaw lam pana a kal chuan hêng chhiatna nasa tak, kan chunga lo thleng hi ama tih a ni ngei ang. A kal loh erawh chuan min hremtu chu amah ni lovin kan chunga vânduaina lo thleng ve hrim hrim a ni ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An hrilh ang chuan an ti ta a; bâwngpui hnute sâwr lai pahnih chu tawlailîr an hnuhtîr a, an note chu in lamah an khung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa Bâwm chu tawlailîrah chuan an dah a, rangkachaka siam ngâwt leh chaichîm lem nên chuan an dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bâwngpuite chu Beth-semes panin dîng takin an kal a, bû chung zêlin kawngpui chu an zawh a, ding lamah emaw, vei lamah emaw an pêng hauh lo. Filistia lalte chuan Beth-semes ramri thlengin an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Beth-semes mite chuan ruamah buh an lo seng a; an han dâk a, bâwm chu an hmu ta a, an hlim hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tawlailîr chuan Beth-semes khuaa mi Josua lo a va thleng a, lungpui lian tak awmnaah chuan a ding ta reng a, tawlailîr thing chu an ek a, bâwngpuite chu Lalpa hnêna hâlral thilhlanah an hmang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levia chite chuan Thuthlung Bâwm leh rangkachak ngâwt leh chaichîm dahna bâwm chu an chawi sawn a, lungpuiah chuan an hûng a. Beth-semes khuaa mite chuan chumi ni vêk chuan hâlral leh thilhlan dangte chu Lalpa hmaah an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Filistia lal panga chuan an en reng a, chumi ni chuan Ekron khaw lamah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An khawpui panga Asdod te, Gaza te, Askelon te, Gath te leh Ekron pual ṭheuhvin Filistia-ho chuan rangkachaka siam ngâwt lem panga Lalpa tân sual manah an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kulh nei leh nei lo khuaa an lal panga hming kimin rangkachak chaichîm lem panga an telh bawk a. Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm chu Beth-semes khaw mi Josua lova lungpui chungah an rawn dah a; chu lungpui chu tûn thlengin a la awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa Bâwm chhûng an en avâng chuan Beth-semes khuaa mite chu a hrem a, mi sawmsarih lai a tihlum a. Lalpan a hrem nasat êm avâng chuan mite chu an mangang hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Beth-semes mite chuan, “He Pathian thianghlim Lalpa hmaah hian tu nge ding thei ang le? Kan hnên ata tu hnênah nge a kal leh tâk ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Kiriat-jearim mite hnênah mi an tîr a, “Filistia mite chuan Lalpa Bâwm an rawn dah leh ta a, lo chhuk thla ula, in hnênah i dah chho vang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Kiriat-jearim mite chu an lo kal a, Lalpa Bâwm chu an la chho va, tlânga Abinadaba inah chuan an la lût a, a fapa Eliezara chu Lalpa Bâwm enkawltu atân an serh hrang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kiriat-jearim-ah chuan Bâwm chu kum rei tak, kum sawmhnih lai a awm ta a. Israel mite chuan Lalpa chu an ngai hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samuela chuan Israel chhûng tin hnênah, “Thinlung leh tihtakzetin Lalpa lam hawi ula, ram dang pathiante leh Astarte limte chu dah bo ula, Lalpa hnênah chauh thilhlante hlân ula, a rawng chauh bâwl rawh u; tichuan, Filistia mite kut ata hi a chhan chhuak dâwn che u nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel-te chuan Baal pathiante leh Astarte limte chu an paih bo va. Lalpa rawng chauh an bâwl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samuela chuan, “Israel mi zawng zawng Mizpa khuaah lo kal khâwm ula, Lalpa hmaah ka ṭawngṭaisak ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mizpa khuaah chuan an kal khâwm a, tui an chawi a, Lalpa hmaah an leihbua a, chumi ni chuan chaw an nghei a; chutah chuan “ Lalpa lakah kan lo sual ta a ni,” tiin an inpuang a. Mizpa khuaah chuan Samuela chu Israel-te chunga rorêltuah a ṭang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Filistia mite chuan Mizpa khuaah Israel-te an kal khâwm tih an hriat chuan, Filistia rorêltute chu anmahni bei tûrin an lo chho va. Chu chu Israel-ten an hriat chuan Filistia-hote chu an hlau ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Samuela hnênah chuan, “Filistia mite laka kan him theih nân kan Pathian, Lalpa hnênah min dîlsak ngat ngat rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Samuela chuan, berâmno hnute hne lai a la a, hâlral thilhlanah Lalpa hnênah a hlân a, Israel mite tân Lalpa hnênah a dîlsak a. Lalpa chuan a chhâng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Samuelan hâlral thilhlan a hlan lai tak chuan Israel-te bei tûrin Filistia mite chuan an rawn pan a; nimahsela, Lalpa chuan chumi ni chuan Filistia mite chungah khawpui nasa takin a rîktîr dur dur a, chu chuan a timangang a, Israel-te hma ata chu an tlân darh ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mite chu Mizpa khua aṭang chuan an lo chhuak a, Filistia mite chu an ûm ta a, Beth-kar hnuai thlengin kawngah chuan an that zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Samuela chuan lung a la a, Mizpa leh Sen inkârah chuan a phun a, “Hei chen hi Lalpan min pui a ni,” tiin a hmingah Eben-ezer a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Filistia mite chu an tlâwm ta a, Israel ram chu an rûn leh ta lo va. Samuela dam chhûng zawng Lalpa chuan Filistia mite lakah Israel-te chu a vêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Filistia miten Ekron leh Gath inkâra Israel-te khua an lâksak zawng zawng chu an pe kîr leh a. Israel-te chuan an ram chu Filistia mite kut ata an la leh a. Israel mite leh Amor mite pawh an inrem ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuela chu a damchhûng zawng Israel-te rorêltu a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kum tin, Bethel te, Gilgal te, Mizpa khua te a tlawh kual a; chûng khuaa Israel-te chu ro a rêlsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A in awmna, Rama khuaah chuan a lo kîr leh ṭhîn a, chuta awm Israel mite chu ro a rêlsak a; tin, chutah vêk chuan Lalpa maichâm a siam a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuela chu a lo upa ta hle a, a fapate chu Israel-te chunga rorêltuah a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A fa tîr hming chu Joela a ni a, a dawttu chu Abija a ni. Anni chuan Beer-seba-ah ro an rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A fate chuan an pa chu an chhûn lo va, dik lo takin ro an rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chûng vâng chuan Israel upa zawng zawng chu Rama khuaa Samuela hnênah chuan an lo kal khâwm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a hnênah, “Hei le, i lo upa ta hle si a, i fapate lah nangmah angin an khawsa si lo va; hnam dangte angin kan chunga rorêltu tûr lal min ruatsak rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hnênah, “Ro min rêlsaktu tûr lal min ruatsak rawh,” an tih avâng chuan Samuela chu a lungni lo hle a, Lalpa hnênah a thlen ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Samuela hnênah, “Mipuiin i hnêna thil an sawi zawng zawng chu ngaithla teh; nang an duh lo che a ni lo, kei hi an lal atân min duh lo tihna a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah ni aṭanga tûn thlengin an thiltih dân zawng zawnga min hawisana, pathian dangte rawng min bâwlsan ṭhîn ang khân i chungah pawh an ti ve ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûnah, an thu ngaithla la, an chunga rorêltu lal chêt dân tûr ngunthlûk takin hrilh vek rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Samuela chuan Lalpa thu sawi zawng zawng chu lal dîltu mipui chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An hnênah, “Hetiang hian in rorêltu lal chu a awm dâwn a ni: In fapate chu a sakawr-tawlailîr leh a sakawr enkawltuah a hmang ang a, a sakawr-tawlailîr hma lamah an tlân ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat sipai sâng hotu-ah te, sawmnga hotu-ah te a ruat ang a; ṭhenkhat a leilettuah te, buh sengtuah te a ruat ang. Ṭhenkhatin indo hmanrua te, a sakawr-tawlailîr thuamte an siam ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In fanute chu rimtui siamtuah te, chawchhûmtu atân te, chhang siamtu atânte a hmang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In lo te, in grep huan te, in oliv huan te, a ṭha ṭha a chhuhsak ang che u a, a ṭhuihruaite hnênah a pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In thlai leh in grep thar aṭangin sâwma pakhat a la ang a, hotute leh a ṭhuihruaite a pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />In chhiahhlawh mipa te, in chhiahhlawh hmeichhia te, in tlangvâl chak te, in sabengtung te a hna thawktu atân a lâksak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In berâm rual zîng ata sâwma pakhat a lâksak ang che u a, a chhiahhlawhah in ṭang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In thlan lalte lakah chhantu dîla in au hun a lo thleng dâwn; chutih hunah chuan Lalpa chuan a chhâng lo vang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mahse, mipui chuan Samuela thu chu an ngaithla duh lo va, “Ni lo, lal kan nei ngei tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tichuan, hnam dang zawng zawng ang kan lo ni ang a, kan lal chuan ro min rêlsak ang a, kan râl dote min dopui dâwn a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Samuela chuan mipui thu sawi zawng zawng chu a hria a, Lalpa hnênah a thlen leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Samuela hnênah, “An thu chu zâwm la, lal chu ruatsak rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, Samuelan Israel mite hnênah, “Mi tin mahni khuaah haw ṭheuh rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin thlah, mi pakhat huaisen tak leh chak tak a awm a, a hming chu Kisa a ni. Kisa chu Abiela fapa a ni, Abiela chu Zerora fapa a ni a, Zerora chu Bakorata fapa a ni, Bakorata chu Afia fapa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kisa chuan fapa a nei a, a hming chu Saula a ni. Ani chu tlangvâl hmêlṭha tak a ni a, Israel-te zîngah a tluka hmêlṭha tu mah an awm lo va, a koki thleng pawh an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saula pa sabengtungte chu a bo va. Kisa chuan a fapa Saula hnênah, “Chhiahhlawh zînga pakhat hruai la, sabengtung bo va zawng teh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Efraim tlângram an fang vek a, Salisa ramte pawh an fang a; mahse, an hmu chuang lo. Saalim ram an fang leh a, chutah pawh chuan a awm lo va; tichuan, Benjamin mite ram an fang leh a; mahse, chutah pawh chuan an hmu ta lo fo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zufa ram an thlen chuan Saulan a chhiahhlawh hruai hnênah, “Khai, i hâwng teh ang, ka pain sabengtung ai mahin keimahni min ngaihtuah dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chuan, “E taka, he khuaah hian Pathian mi, mi zahawm tak a awm a, a sawi apiang a thleng dik ṭhîn. Tûnah a hnênah kal ila, kan thil zawn kan hmuh theihna tûr kawng min hrilh thei mial mahna,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saula chuan a chhiahhlawh hnênah, “Kal ila, ani chu eng nge kan pêk ang? Kan chhang bâwm a ruak vek tawh si a, Pathian mi hnêna pêk tûr eng mah kan nei hauh lo, eng nge kan la neih le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh chuan ani chu a chhâng a, “En teh, hei, pawisa tlêm chu kan la nei e, Pathian mi chu ka pe ang a; tichuan, kan kalna tûr chu min hrilh mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûn hmain Israel-te zîngah miin Pathian râwn an duh chuan, ‘hawh teh, hmutheitua hnênah i kal teh ang,’ an ti ṭhîn. Tûnlaia zâwlnei hi tûn hma chuan hmutheitu an ti ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saulan a chhiahhlawh hnênah, “A ṭhat chu, i kal teh ang hmiang,” a ti a. Pathian mi awmna khuaah chuan an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khawpui pana tlânga an chhoh lai chuan nula rual tuichawi tûr an tâwk a, “Hetah hian hmutheitua a awm em?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Awm e, in lo thlen hma lawk khân a lo thleng a; hmanhmawh ula, vawiinah hmunsângah mi an inthawi a, kan khuaah a lo thleng chiah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khua in han luh veleh inthawina hmuna chaw a ei hmain in han hmu mai ang. A thlen hma chuan miten chaw an ei lo vang; chu inthawina malsâwmna sawitu tûr chu a ni a, chumi zawhah mi sâwmte chuan chaw an ei thei a ni. Chho zêl ula, in han hmu mai ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khuaah chuan an chho va, an han luh chuan inthawina hmuna Samuela kal tûr chu an han hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saula lo thlen hma ni chuan Lalpa chuan Samuela chu a lo hrilh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Naktûk tûn ang hunah Benjamin chi mi pakhat i hnênah ka rawn tîr dâwn; ani chu ka mi Israel-te hotu atân hriak thih la; ani chuan Filistia mite kut ata ka mite chu a chhan chhuak ang. Ka mite au thâwm ka beng a lo thleng ta a, ka ngaihven dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samuelan Saula a hmuh veleh Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “I hnêna ka sawi kha he mi hi a ni; ani chuan ka mite ro a rêlsak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Saula chuan kulh kawngka bula Samuela awm chu a va hnaih a, “Hmutheitua in hi khawiah nge a awm, khawngaih takin min hrilh thei em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Samuela chuan, “Hmutheitua chu keimah hi ka ni, inthawina hmun panin ka hmaah chho ve la, vawiinah ka hnênah chaw ei ang che u. Naktûk zîngah in thil duh chu ka hrilh ang che u a; tichuan, in kal dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In sabengtung, ni thum lai bo tawh chu lungkham suh u, an hmu tawh e. Israel-te mamawh ber chu tu nge ni? Nang leh i pa chhûngte hi an ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saula chuan, “Israel hnam zînga te ber, Benjamina hnam ka ni a, kan chhûngkua pawh Benjamin chi zînga tê ber kan ni asin. Engtizia nge ka hnêna chutiang thu i sawi le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Samuela chuan Saula leh a chhiahhlawh chu pindan lian takah a hruai lût a, an mi sâwm sawmthum zîngah chuan a hmun ṭha berah a ṭhuttîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Samuela chuan chawchhûmtu hnênah chuan, “Dah hran tûr ka tih che sahrang kha han la rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, chawchhûmtu chuan a bawp a rawn la a, Saula hmaah chuan a hlui a. Samuela chuan, “Hei hi i chanpual tûr a ni, ei rawh, ka mi sâwmte nên tûna kan ei ho atân kan khêk a nih kha,” a ti a. Chumi ni chuan Saula chu Samuela te nên chaw an kîl ho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Inthawina hmun aṭanga khuaa an chhuk hnu chuan Samuela chuan Saula chu in chung zâwlah a titipui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zîng takah an tho va, Samuela chuan in chunga Saula awm chu a ko va, “Insiam la, ka kaltîr tawh ang che” a ti a. Saula chu a insiam a, Samuela nên chuan an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kawtchhuah an zu thlen chuan Samuelan Saula hnênah, “I chhiahhlawh hi kal hmasaktîr teh,” a ti a; chhiahhlawh chu a kal ta a. “Nang chu hetah ding rih la, Pathian thu lo thleng ka hrilh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuela chuan hriak bâwm chu a la a, Saula lu-ah chuan a leih a, a fâwp a, “A mi Israel-te chunga rorêltu atân Lalpa chuan hriak a thih ta che. Lalpa mite chungah ro i rêl ang a, anni chu an vêla an hmêlmate kut ata i chhan chhuak ang. Tin, hei hi, a mi Israel-te chunga rorêltu atân Lalpa chuan hriak a thih che a ni tih chhinchhiahna a ni ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vawiina min kalsan hnu hian Benjamin ramri Zelza hmun, Rakili thlân kiangah, mi pahnih i tâwk ang a, anni chuan i hnênah, ‘I sabengtung zawnte kha an hmu tawh e; i pa pawhin sabengtungte chu a ngaihtuah tawh lo, nangmah mawlh hi a ngaihtuah che a ni, ‘ka fapa chu engtin tak awm ang maw, a ti a ti mai,’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Chuta ṭang chuan kal zêl la, Tabor hmuna sasaw thing dinna i va thleng ang a, chutah chuan Bethel hmuna Pathian be tûr mi pathumin an tâwk ang che a, pakhat chuan kêlno pathum a pawm ang a, pakhatin chhang tlang thum a keng ang, pakhat leh chuan uain bûr a keng bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chibai an bûk ang che a, chhang tlang hnih an pe ang che a, la ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi hnuah Gibea hmuna Pathian tlâng, Filistia sipaiho hmun i va thleng ang a; tin, khua i luh dâwn chuan zâwlnei rual an hmahruaituten perhkhuang te, benchhek te, phênglâwng te, ṭingṭang te tum chungin hmunsâng aṭanga lo chhuk i tâwk ang, thu an sawi dual dual ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa thlarau chu nasa takin i chungah a lo thleng ang a, an ṭawng ang chuan i ṭawng ve ang a; tichuan, i nun a lo danglam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, hêng chhinchhiahna hi i chunga a lo thlen kim hunah Pathianin a awmpui dâwn che a, a hruai ang zêl chein awm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilgal-ah lo zu kal hmasa la, kei pawh hâlral thilhlante leh remna thilhlante hlân tûrin i hnênah ka lo chhuk ve ang. I hnêna ka lo kala, tih tûr ka rawn hrilh hma che chuan ni sarih thleng min lo nghâk ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saulan Samuela a kalsan veleh Pathianin Saula chu thinlung thar a pe a, chung chhinchhiahna zawng zawng chu chumi ni chuan a chungah a lo thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gibea tlâng an han thlen chuan zâwlneiho chuan an lo tâwk a; tichuan, Pathian thlarauvin a man thut a, anmahni angin thu a sawi a, a lâm ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tûn hmaa amah lo hre tawhten zâwlneiho angin thu a sawi ve ta tih an hmuh chuan, “Kisa fapa chungah hian eng thil nge lo thleng ta le? Saula chu zâwlnei zîngah a tel ve ta a ni maw?” tiin an inzâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chu khuaa mi pakhat chuan a chhâng a, “Hêng zâwlneiho pawh hi, an pate tute nge an nih bîk?” a ti a. “Saula zâwlnei a ni ve ta elo?” tih chu ṭawngkam takah an neih ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zâwlnei anga thu a sawi zawh chuan Saula chu hmunsâng lamah a chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Saula pami chuan Saula leh a chhiahhlawh chu, “Khawi lamah nge in kal?” tiin a zâwt a. Ani chuan, “Sabengtung kan zawng a; kan hmuh zawh tâk loh avângin Samuela hnênah kan kal ta a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saula pami chuan, “Samuela chuan in hnênah thu eng nge a sawi min hrilh teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Saula chuan, “Sabengtung chu an hmu leh tawh tih min lo hrilh,” a ti a. Samuelan lal tûra a lo tih thu erawh chu a pami chu a hrilh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samuela chuan mipui chu Mizpa khuaah Lalpa be tûrin a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel fate hnênah chuan, “Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Israel-te chu Aigupta ram aṭangin ka hruai chhuak a; Aigupta-ho kut ata leh nangmahni tiduhdahtu lal zawng zawng lak ata ka chhan chhuak che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In manganna leh chhiatna tinrêng laka chhanchhuaktu che u in Pathian ka ni a; nimahsela, tûnah min duh lo va, rorêlsaktu tûr lal min dîl a. Chuvângin, tûnah, a hnam leh a chi chiin Lalpa hmaah rawn inlan ṭheuh rawh u,’ a ti e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Samuela chuan Israel hnam zawng zawng chu a rawn inlantîr a; Benjamina hnam chu ṭhumvâwra thlan an lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin hnam chu a chhûng chhûngin an rawn inlan leh a, Matria chhûngte chu thlan an lo ni leh ta zêl a. A tâwpah Kisa fapa Saula chu thlan a ni ta a. Ani chu an han zawng a, an hmu ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa an râwn nawn leh a, “Ani hi a lo kal em ni?” an ti a. Lalpa chuan, “Kal e, bungraw zîngah a biru a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, an tlân a, an va hruai chhuak a, mi zînga a han din chuan a sâng ber a, a koki pêl pawh an awm hauh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Samuelan mi zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa mi ruat hi in hmu em? Mi zawng zawng zîngah amah ang rêng an awm loh hi,” a ti a. Mipui chu an au va, “Lal chu dam reng rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Samuela chuan mipuite chu lal dinhmun leh a tih tûrte a hrilh a; lehkhabu-ah a ziak a, Lalpa inah a dah ta a. Samuela chuan mite chu an in lamah a hâwntîr ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Saula pawh Gibea khuaa a inah a haw ve ta a, mi huaisen, an thinlung Pathianin a khawihte chuan an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat, kawhmawhbâwlho erawh chuan, “Engtin nge he pa hian min chhanhim theih tehlul ang?” an ti a. Ani chu an hmusit hle a, thilpêk eng mah an pe duh lo va. Saula erawh chu a ngawi reng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amon mi Nahasa chu Gilead rama Jabes khua bei tûrin a lo thawk a, a rawn hual a. Jabes mi zawng zawng chuan, “Kan hnênah thu thlung la, i rawng kan bâwl ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amon mi Nahasa chuan, “In hnêna thu ka thlun dân tûr chu hetiang hi a ni ang: In mitmu ding lam ka kher chhuak vek ang a, chu chu Israel mi zawng zawng ka tihmualpho dân tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jabes khaw upaho chuan a hnênah, “Israel ram pumah zualko kan tlântîr theih nân ni sarih chhûng hun min pe rawh; chutah min chhantu tûr tu mah an lo lan loh chuan i hnênah kan inpe ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, zualkote chuan Saula awmna Gibea khua an va thleng a, mipui hnênah chuan chu thu chu an hrilh a. Mi zawng zawng chu mangangin an ṭap ta chuah chuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Saula chu a bâwng khalhin lo lam aṭangin a lo hâwng a. Saula chuan, “Engati nge mipui chu an ṭah chuah chuah le?” a ti a. Jabes khaw mite thu rawn thlen chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng thu chu Saulan a hriat veleh Pathian thlarau chu a chungah a lo thleng chiam a, a thin a rim ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bâwngpa pahnih a talh a, a sa chu a chansawm a, ram pumah a semtîr a, “Tu pawh Saula leh Samuela zui duh lo chu an bâwng hetianga tihsak a ni ang,” tiin a hrilh vek a. Mipui chuan Lalpa chu an hlau ta hle a, thukhat vuain an lo thawk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Bezek hmunah a lo chhiar a, Israel mi chu nuaithum an ni a, Juda mi chu sîngthum an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi tirhte hnênah chuan, “Jabes mite chu ‘Naktûk ni tlângsân hmain kan chhan chhuak ang che u,’ tiin va hrilh rawh u,” an ti a. Mi tirhte chu an hâwng ta a, Jabes mite chu an va hrilh a; anni chu an lâwm ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jabes mite chuan, “Naktûkah in hnênah kan inpe ang a; tichuan, in duh duhin min ti dâwn nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Saula chuan mipui chu pâwl thumah a ṭhen a, vârṭianah Amon mite riahhmun an luhchilh a, ni tlângsân fe thlengin an that ta chiam a. An thah bangte chu an tlân darh vek a, pahniha awm dûn rêng rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mite chuan Samuela hnênah, “ ‘Saulan kan chungah ro a rêl tehlul ang maw’ titute kha tute nge ni? Chûng mite chu rawn hruai la, kan lo that ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Saula erawh chuan, “Vawiinah tu mah tihhlum tûr a ni lo; vawiinah hian Israel-te chu Lalpan a chhan chhuak ta si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samuela chuan mipui hnênah, “Hawh u, Gilgal-ah kal ila, chutah chuan lal neih hi i tinghet ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mipui chu Gilgal-ah chuan an kal ta a, Saula chu Lalpa hmaah lal atân an tinghet ta a; tin, Lalpa hnênah inthawina an hlân ho va, Saula leh Israel mi zawng zawng chu an lâwm hle a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuela chuan Israel mi zawng zawng hnênah, “Ngai teh u, ka hnêna in sawi apiang ka ngaithla a, lal ka ruatsak ta che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tûnah hian nangmahni hruaitu tûr lal in nei ta a. Kei chu ka lo tarin ka lute pawh a lo ṭuak ta a, ka fapate pawh in zîngah an awm a. Ka tleirâwl aṭanga vawiin thlengin ka kaihruai che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khai le, Lalpa hmaah leh a hriakthih lal hmaah hian ka sualna han sawi teh u. Tu bâwngpa nge ka chhuhsaka, tu sabengtung nge ka chhuhsak ngai le? Tu nge ka buma, tu nge ka tihduhdah in hria em? Ka mit tidel tûrin thamna ka la ngai em ni? Hêng hi ka lo ti a nih chuan ka rûl leh vek ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anni chuan “Min bum ngai lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samuela chuan an hnênah, “Vawiin hian ka tihsual eng mah in hmu lo tih Lalpa leh a hriakthih lal chu hretu an ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Samuela chuan mipui hnênah, “ Lalpa chu Mosia leh Arona ruattu leh in pute Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaktu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, ngun takin ngaithla rawh u, Lalpan in pute leh in chunga dik taka thil a tih ṭhin dân Lalpa hmaah ka hrilh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta rama Jakoba a luh hnu khân in pute chuan puitu atân LALPA an au va; LALPA chuan Mosia leh Arona a tîr a, in pute chu Aigupta ram ata a hruai chhuak a, he ramah hian a awmtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpa , an Pathian chu an theihnghilh a, ani chuan Hazor khaw sipai hotu Sisera kutah te, Filistia-ho kutah te, Moab lal kutah te a pe a, anni chuan an rawn hneh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu an au va, ‘ Lalpa kan hawisan a, Baal te, Aseri rawngte kan bâwl avângin kan lo bawhchhe ta a ni. Tûnah kan hmêlmate lak ata min chhan chhuak la; tichuan, i rawng kan bâwl ang,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, Jerubaala te, Bedana te, Jeftha te, Samuela te a tîr a, anni chuan hmun tina in hmêlmate lak ata an chhan chhuak che u a, him takin in awm ta ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Amon mite lal Nahasa chu nangmahni do tûra a lo kal in hmuhin Lalpa in Pathian chu in lal a ni reng chungin ka hnênah, ‘Kan chunga rorêltu tûr lal kan duh ve,’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tûnah hian lal in dîl leh in thlan chu en teh u. Lalpa chuan lal a pe ta che u a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa in ṭih a, a rawng in bâwla, a thu in awih a, a dân in zawm a, nangni leh in lal, in chunga rorêltute nên chuan Lalpa in Pathian in zui chuan a ṭha ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Lalpa aw in pawisak lohva, a dân in zawm loh chuan in puten Lalpa kut an tuar ang khân nangni pawhin in tuar ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tûnah, ngaithla ngun rawh u, in tân thil ropui tak in mit hmuha a tih tûr hi lo en rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vawiinah hian huit an seng a ni lâwm ni? Khawpui rîktîr tûr leh ruah sûrtîr tûrin Lalpa chu ka au vang a; tichuan, lal dîl thu-ah hian Lalpa lakah thil in tihsual nasatzia in hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Samuela chuan Lalpa chu a au va, chumi ni chuan Lalpa chuan khawpui a rîktîr a, ruah a sûrtîr bawk a; tichuan, mi zawng zawngin Lalpa leh Samuela chu an hlau ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mite chuan Samuela hnênah, “Kan thih loh nân i chhiahhlawhte hi Lalpa , i Pathian hnênah min dîlsak teh, kan sualna dang zawng zawng belhchhahin he thil ṭha lo tak, lal hi kan lo dîl ta si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Samuela chuan mipui hnênah, “He thil ṭha lo tak hi in lo ti ngei tak a; mahse, Lalpa chu hawisan chuang lo ula; tih tak zetin Lalpa rawng chu bâwl zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ṭangkaina nei lo milem chu be suh u, thil ṭha an tihsak lo che u a, an chhan chhuak thei hek lo che u a ni, engmah lo mai mai an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A hming ropui tak avângin Lalpa chuan a mite a paihthla dâwn lo. Lalpa chuan a mi atâna siam che u hi a lawmzâwng tak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei pawhin ṭawngṭaisak che u bânsana, Lalpa chunga sual chu ka tân tih theih a ni lo. Thil dik leh ṭha chu ka kawhhmuh zêl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Lalpa hi ṭih ula, rinawm tak leh ṭhahnemngai takin a rawng hi bâwl ang che u; in tân thil ropui tak a tihte kha hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In sual luih zêl erawh chuan in lalte nên lam in boral vek ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saula chuan kum hnih chhûng Israel ramah ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saula chuan Israel mi sângthum a thlang chhuak a. Mikmas-ah leh Bethel tlângramah a hovin an awm a, sângkhat chu Benjamin bial Gibea khuaah Jonathana hovin an awm a, mi dang chu a hâwntîr vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jonathana chuan Geba hmuna Filistia sipai hmun chu a la a; chu chu Filistia mite chuan an lo hria a, Saula chuan “Hebrai mite khân lo hre rawh se,” tiin ram pumah tawtawrâwt a hamtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawng chuan, “Saulan Filistia sipai awmna hmun a bei a, Israel-te chungah chuan Filistia mite chu an thinur hle,” tih thu an lo hria a. Tichuan, Saula pui tûrin Gilgal-ah mipui an lo kal khâwm ta chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Filistia mite pawh Israel-te do tûrin an lo pung khâwm bawk a; tawlailîr sîngthum, sakawr chungchuang mi sângruk leh sipai, tuifinriat kama ṭiau zât lai an ni, Beth-aven chhak lam Mikmas hmunah an lo chho va, ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mite chuan an dinhmun hlauhawmzia leh dan chêp an nih an inhriatin pûkah te, lei kuaah te, lungpui phênah te, tuichhunchhuahah te an biru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hebrai mi ṭhenkhat chu Jordan râla Gad ram leh Gilead ramah te an tlânchhia a. Saula chu Gilgal-ah a awm reng a, a hnêna sipai awm zawng zawng chu hlauvin an khûr an khûr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Samuelan a lo tiam angin ni sarih a nghâk a, mahse, Samuela chu Gilgal-ah a lo kal lo va; tichuan, mite chuan an tlânchhiatsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saula chuan, “Hâlral thilhlan tûr leh remna thilhlan tûrte chu ka hnênah han la rawh u” a ti a, hâlral thilhlan chu a hlân ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hâlral thilhlante a hlân zo chiah tihah Samuela chu a lo thleng a, lo dawngsawng tûrin Saula chu a chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samuela chuan, “Eng nge i tih le?” a ti a. Saula chuan, “Miten min tlânsan tawh tih ka hria a, nang lah chu i ni ruatah i lo thleng bawk si lo. Filistia mite chu Mikmas-ah an pung khâwm luih tawh mai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gilgal-ah min rawn bei ṭêp a ni a; min pui tûrin Lalpa ka la ngên bawk si lo; chuvângin, hâlral thilhlan chu hlân lo thei ka ni lo va ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samuela chuan, “I thil tih dân hi a âtthlâk hle a ni. Lalpa , i Pathianin dân a pêk che hi i zâwm lo va, zâwm la chu Lalpan Israel-te chungah kumkhuain a laltîr tûr che a ni a le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, i lalna chu a tâwp dâwn ta, Lalpa thupêk i zawm loh avângin Lalpa chuan a mi duhzâwng tak a zawng a, a mite chunga rorêltu tûr a ruat tawh a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuela chuan Gilgal chu a chhuahsan a, Benjamin biala Gibea khuaah chuan a chho va, Saula chuan a hnêna la awm ve chu a chhiar a, zaruk lai an la ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Saula leh a fapa leh an hnêna mi la awmte chuan Benjamin biala Gibea khuaah ṭan an la a, Filistia-ho erawh chuan Mikmas-ah ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Filistia zînga râl hrât zualte chu pâwl thumah an inṭhen a, an bûk aṭang chuan pâwl khatin Sual rama Ofra lam an pan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />pâwl khatin Beth-horon lam an pan a; pâwl dang leh chuan thlalêr dep Zeboim ruam lam hawi ramri kawng an zawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Filistia mite chuan Israel ram pum puiah thîrdêng awm an phal lo va, “Hebrai mite hian, khandaih te, fei te an siam dah ang e,” an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel mite chu bâwngtuthlawh te, leilehna thîr te, hreipui te, leilehna hmanrua te tah hriamtîr tûrin Filistia mite hnênah an chhuk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bâwngtuthlawh leh lungrâl tihhriam man chu duli pahnih a ni a. Thîr hmâwr zum te, hreipui te, chhuntiang te tihhriam man chu duli a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An indo ni chuan Saula leh a fapa Jonathana chauh lo chuan an hote tu mahin khandaih emaw, fei emaw an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Filistia mite chuan an sipai pâwl khat chu Mikmas kalkhân vêng tûrin an tîr a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat chu Saula fapa Jonathana chuan a râlthuam kengtu hnênah, “Hawh, râl lehlama Filistia sipai hmunah sâwn i va kal teh ang,” a ti a. A pa chu a hrilh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saula chu Gibea ram hmâwr Migron hmuna theibuhfai buk hnuaiah a awm a. A hnêna awm sipaite chu zaruk lai an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Puithiam Ahija pawh puithiam kawr hain a awm bawk a. Ani hi Silo khuaa Lalpa puithiam, Elia fa Finehasa fapa Ikaboda unaupa Ahituba fa a ni. Jonathana chu râl lehlamah a kal tawh tih tu mahin an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Filistia sipai bûk Jonathanan a panna khân sîr tawnah chuan lungpui tohlâwt a awm a: a pakhat hming chu Boze a ni a, pakhat dang chu Senea a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pakhat chu hmâr lam Mikmas lam hawi zâwngin a awm a, pakhat chu chhim lam Geba hawi zâwngin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jonathanan a râlthuam kengtu tlangvâl hnênah chuan, “Hawh, serh tan lohho awmnaah sâwn i kal teh ang, Lalpan min ṭanpui ngei ang. An tam emaw, an tlêm emaw Lalpa tân min hnehtîr harsatna eng mah a awm lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A râlthuam kengtu chuan, “I duh ang chuan ti la, ka zui zêl ang che. Ka phatsan lo vang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jonathana chuan, “Aw le, hnaih ila, hmuh tûrin i va inlan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘In hnêna kan lo kal hma chu lo awm rawh u,’ min tih chuan kan hmunah kan awm reng ang a, an hnênah kan chho lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Lo chho teh rêng u,’ min tih chuan kan chho vang a, chu chu Lalpan anni chu kan kutah min pe tawh a ni tih chhinchhiahna a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, an pahnihin Filistia sipaiho hmuh tûrin an va inlan a. Filistia mite chuan, “En teh u, Hebrai mite an bihrûkna hmun ata an lo chhuak e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vênbûka sipaite chuan Jonathana leh a râlthuam kengtu chu an au va, “Lo chho teh rêng u, in hre mai ang,” an ti a. Jonathana chuan a râlthuam kengtu hnênah chuan, ‘Mi rawn zui chho rawh, Lalpa chuan anni chu Israel-te kutah a pe ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jonathana chu a vâk chho ta a, a râlthuam kengtu chuan a zui zêl a. Jonathana hmaah chuan anni chu an tlu ta zawih zawih a, a hnungah a râlthuam kengtu chuan a rawn that zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Inbeih hmasak ber ni chuan Jonathana leh a râlthuam kengtu chuan fîng chanve vêl chhûngah chauh mi sawmhnih lai an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sipai zawng zawng, riahbûka awm te, phûla awm te, vênbûka awm te, hmatâwng pâwlte chu an chiai a, an buai ta mur mur a. Lîr te a nghîng a, Pathianin manganna nasa tak a thlentîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Benjamin bial Gibea khuaa Saula râlvengtu sipaite chuan an han thlîr a; ngai teh, Filistia-ho chu mangang takin an tlân darh chum chum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saula chuan a sipaite hnênah, “Inchhiar ula, tute nge kim lo han en teh u,” a ti a. An han inchhiar chuan Jonathana leh a râlthuam kengtu chu an lo awm ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Saula chuan Ahija hnênah, “Puithiam kawr kha han phawrh teh,” a ti a. Ani chuan puithiam kawr chu Israel-te hmaah a ha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saulan puithiam a biak lai chuan Filistia riahhmuna an buaina chu a zual tawlh tawlh a, Saulan puithiam hnênah chuan, “Dah leh mai rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Saula leh a hnêna mipui awmte chu an pung khâwm a, indona hmunah an kal ta a. Ngai teh, Filistia mite chu anmahni leh anmahni khandaihin an lo inbei chiam a, an buai nuai nuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tûn hma lama Filistia ṭan ṭhîn Hebrai mite leh riahhmuna lo awmte chu Israel lamah an lo pakai a, Saula leh Jonathana lamah an ṭang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin Efraim tlângrama Israel mi, biru zawng zawng pawh chu Filistia mite an tlânchhia tih an hriatin indonaah chuan an lo tel ve a, an rawn ûm ve nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Israel-ho chu Lalpan a hnehtîr a, Beth-aven thleng rawkin an bei zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saulan mipuite chu a vau va, “Ka hmêlmate chunga phuba ka lâk ni hian khaw thim hmaa chaw ei chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se,” a tih avângin chumi ni chuan tu man eng mah an ei lo, Israel-te chu an chau hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mipui chuan ngaw an va thleng a, khawizu a lo tam hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mipuiin ngaw chhûng an luh chuan khawizu chu a lo far zawih zawih a, ânchhe dawn an hlauh avângin tu man an pir lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jonathana erawh chuan a pain mipui a vauna kha a hre ve lo va, tiang hmawrin khawithlâr chu a chhun a, a han tem a, a lo harh ta sawt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An zînga mi pakhat chuan a hnênah, “I pain hetiangin min vau asin, ‘Tu pawh, vawiina chaw ei apiangin ânchhia dawng rawh se,” a tih avângin mite chu an chau zo ta a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jonathana chuan, “Ka pa hian mite tân harsatna a siam mai mai a nih hi; en ta che u, kei pawhin khawizu tlêm tê ka han tem a, ka harh tâk hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Mite hian an hmêlmate laka an thil lâk hi an duh duhin vawiin hian ei sela chu an chak phah ang a, Filistia mite hi kan that tam lehzual tûr’” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Filistia mite chu an hneh a, Mikmas aṭangin Aijalon thlengin an ûm a, Israel-te pawh chu an chau ve ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mite chuan an râllâk thil: berâm te, bâwngpa te, bâwngno te chu an la sawk sawk a, leiah an phet thlu a, an talh a, a thisen chawpin an ei ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Saula hnênah, “Mite chuan thisen chawpin sa an ei a Lalpa lakah thil an tisual ta e,” tiin an sawi a. Ani chuan, “Dik lo takin thil in ti ta a ni, hetah hian lung min han lâk teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Saulan chûng mite hnênah chuan, “Vâk darh ula, mi hnênah, ‘mi tinin bâwngpa leh berâm han la sela, hetah hian talh sela, ei rawh se. A thisen chawpa eiin Lalpa chungah thil tisual suh u,’ tiin hrilh rawh u,” a ti a. Chumi zân chuan an bâwngpa an rawn kai ṭheuh va, chutah chuan an talh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Saula chuan Lalpa tân maichâm a siam a, chu chu Lalpa tâna a maichâm siam hmasak ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Saula chuan, “Zânah Filistia mite chu bei ila, zîng khaw ên thlengin i bei ang u, tu mah zuah tûr a ni lo,” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Ṭha i tih ang chuan ti rawh,” an ti a. Puithiam erawh chuan, “Pathian i râwn rih ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Saula chuan, “Filistia mite chu ka zu bei ang em? Israel-te kutah i pe ang em?” tiin a zâwt a. Chumi ni chuan Pathianin a chhâng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Saula chuan, “Nangni mipui hotu zawng zawngte u, lo hnai ula, vawiin hian eng nge kan tihsual hriat chhuah i tum teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te chhanhimtu, mi nunga chhâlin ka sawi e, ka fapa Jonathana tihsual pawh ni se, a thi ngei tûr a ni,” a ti a. Nimahsela, mipui zîng aṭangin tu mahin an chhang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “Inbûk ila, nangniho hi lehlamah ṭang ula, kei leh ka fapa Jonathana hi lehlamah kan ṭang ang e,” a ti a. Mite chuan Saula hnênah, “Ṭha i tih ang chuan ti mai rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Saula chuan Israel-te Pathian hnênah chuan, “A dik tak chu han tar lang ta che,” a ti a. Ṭhumvâwr chu Saula leh Jonathana chungah chuan a tla a, mipui chu an fihlîm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Saula chuan, “Kei leh ka fapa Jonathana thlei nân ṭhumvâwr rawh u,” a ti a. Jonathana chungah chuan a tla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Saula chuan Jonathana hnênah, “Eng nge i tihsual min hrilh rawh” a ti a. Jonathana chuan a hnênah, “Ka tiang hmâwra khawizu tlêm chu ka tem ngei alâwm; chuvângin, ka thi mai tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Saula chuan, “Jonathan, i thi ngei tûr a ni, i thih loh chuan na deuh pawhin Pathianin a tih tihin min ti rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mite chuan Saula hnênah, “Israel-te tâna hnehna ropui tak thlentu Jonathana hi a thi ang maw? A thi tawp lo vang. Lalpa nunna chhâlin kan sawi e, a samzai pakhat pawh leiah a tla lo vang,” an ti a. Mipui chuan Jonathana chu thi lo tûrin an chhan chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Saulan Filistia mi a ûm chu a kîrsan a, Filistia mite pawh an ram lamah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Saula chu Israel lal a lo nih chuan kil tina an hmêlma Moab mi te, Amon mi te, Edom mi te, Zoba lal te, Filistia mite chu a do va. A hawina lam apiangah a hneh zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Huai takin a bei a. Amalek mite pawh a hneh a, Israel-te chu rapbettute kut ata a chhan chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Saula fate chu Jonathana te, Isvia te, Malkisua te an ni; a fanu upa zâwk chu Merabi a ni a, a naupang zâwk chu Mikali a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Saula nupui hming chu Ahinoami, Ahimaaza fanu a ni. A sipai hotu ber hming chu Abnera a ni, a pami Nera fapa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kisa chu Saula pa a ni a, Abnera pa Nera chu Abiela fapa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />A dam chhûng zawng, Saula chu Filistia mite nên nasa takin an indo ṭhîn a, Saula chuan mi chak emaw, mi huaisen emaw a hmuh apiang lamṭang atân a siam zêl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuela chuan Saula hnênah, “ Lalpan a mi Israel-te chunga rorêltu atân hriak thih tûr chein min tîr a; chuvângin, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, ‘Israel-te chu Aigupta ram ata an lo chhuah lai khân Amalek-hovin kawng lakah an lo tihbuai avângin ka hrem dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amalek-ho bei tûrin chhuak la, an thil neih zawng zawng tiboral vek ang che. A hmei a pa, nausên hnute hne lai chenin, an bâwngpa te, berâm te, sanghâwngsei te, sabengtung te nên tihlum vek ang che,’ a ti e” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Saulan Telem khuaah mipui a ko khâwm a, Israel mi nuaihnih leh Juda mi sîngkhat lai an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Saula chuan Amalek khawpui chu a pan a, ruamah lambun tumin a lo châng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aigupta ram aṭanga Israel-te an lo chhuah khân, Ken mite chuan an lo khawngaih hle a, Saula chuan an hnênah, “Lo chhuak ula, Amalek mite zîng ata inthiarfihlîm rawh u; chutilo zawng an zîngah ka tiboral ve dah ang che u,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Ken mite chu Amalek mite zîng ata chu an chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saula chuan Amalek mite chu Havila aṭanga Aigupta ram dep Sur thlengin a hneh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amalek lal Agaga chu a nung chungin a man a, mi dang zawng chu khandaihin a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saula leh a mite chuan Agaga te, berâm ṭha ṭha te, bâwngpa ṭha leh thau thau te, berâmno ṭha ṭha te chu an tihlum duh lo va, ṭha lo deuh leh an duh loh chauh chu an that vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu Samuela hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Saula, lal atân ka lo ruat ta chu pawi ka ti hle mai; min hawisan a, ka thupêk a zâwm si lo,” a ti a. Samuela chu a thin a ur hle a, zankhuain Lalpa a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Samuela chu zîng takah a tho va, Saula hmuh tumin a chhuak a; mahse “Saula chu Karmel-ah a kal a, chutah chuan dam lai lung a phun a, a lo kîr leh a, Gilgal-ah a chhuk leh ta,” tiin Samuela chu miin an lo hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samuela chuan Saula hnên a lo thleng a, Saula chuan, “ Lalpan malsâwm che rawh se; Lalpa thupêk ang chuan ka ti ta e,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samuela chuan, “Chûng berâm bê leh bâwng bû ka hriatte chu engtizia nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saula chuan, “Amalek mite ta an rawn lâksak a ni. Mite chuan berâm leh bâwng, a ṭha ṭha chu Lalpa , i Pathian hnêna thilhlan atân an rawn la a, a dang zawng chu kan tihlum vek e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samuela chuan Saula hnênah, “Nizâna Lalpan ka hnêna thu a sawi ka hrilh teh ang che,” a ti a. Saula chuan, “Sawi ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Inngai pawimawh lo mah la, Israel hnam hotu atân ruat i ni lâwm ni? Lalpan Israel lal atân hriak a thih che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpan thil ti tûrin a tîr chhuak che a, ‘Kal la, mi sualho, Amalek mite chu tihlum vek rawh, an boral vek hma chuan bei zêl rawh,’ a ti che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Engati nge Lalpa thu zâwm lova râllâk thil i lâk bawrh bawrha, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo i tih le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saula chuan Samuela hnênah, “ Lalpa thu chu ka zâwm alâwm. Lalpa min tirhnaah chuan ka kal a, Amalek lal Agaga ka rawn man a, Amalek mite chu ka that vek asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, mite chuan râllâk thil - berâm leh bâwngte tihboral tûr zînga a ṭha ṭha chu Lalpa i Pathian hnêna Gilgal-a hlan atân an rawn la a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Samuela chuan: “Hâlral thilhlan leh inthawinate aiin: Lalpa chuan a thu awih a lâwm zâwk lo vem ni? Ngai teh, thilhlan aiin thu awih a ṭha zâwk a, Berâmno thau aiin a thu pawm a ṭha zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hei hi aien sualte nên thuhmun a ni. Luhlul hi milem biak tluk a ni. Lalpa thu i zawm loh avângin Ani pawhin lal atân a duh bîk ta lo a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saula chuan Samuela hnênah, “Ka lo tisual dêr mai a, Lalpa thupêk leh i thu ka zâwm lo a ni e, mipui ka hlau va, an thu ka zâwm mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tûnah ka ngên a che, ka sual ngaidam la, Lalpa ka biak theih nân min hawpui leh rawh aw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Samuela chuan Saula hnênah, “Ka hawpui tawp lo vang che, Lalpa thu i duh lo va, Lalpa pawhin Israel-te lal atân a duh bîk ta lo che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Samuela chu kal tuma a han her chuan, Saulan a puan fêmah a lo chelh a, a thlêr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Samuelan a hnênah, “Vawiin aṭang hian Lalpan Israel ram chu a chhuhsak ta che a; mi, nang aia ṭha zâwk mi dang hnênah a pe ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel Miropuia chu a daw lo vang, a lamlêt hek lo vang; mihring anga lamlêt leh mai mi a ni si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Saula chuan, “Ka lo tisual ta a ni; mahse, ka mite zînga upaho leh Israel-te hmaah min zahder hrâm la, min hâwnpui leh rawh; Lalpa i Pathian chu ka bia ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tichuan, Samuelan Saula chu a hâwnpui a, Saula chuan Lalpa chu chibai a bûk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Samuela chuan, “Amalek lal Agaga chu ka hnênah han hruai rawh,” a ti a. Agaga chu khûr chungin a hnênah a va kal a, “Thihna râpthlâk chu ka pumpelh tawh a ni ang chu maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Samuela chuan, “I khandaihin hmeichhiate fa nei lova i siam ṭhîn ang khân i nu pawh hmeichhe zînga fa nei lo nu a ni ang,” a ti a. Samuela chuan Gilgal khuaah Lalpa mit hmuhin a sât sawm ta berh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Samuela chu Rama khuaah a kal a, Saula pawh a awmna Gibea khuaah ama inah a haw chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Samuela chuan a dam chhûngin Saula chu a tlawh leh ta lo va. Samuela chu Saula avâng chuan a rilru a na hle a; Lalpa chuan, Israel lal atân Saula a lo siam chu pawi a ti hle a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Samuela hnênah, “Israel lal atâna Saula ka duh loh avâng hian eng chen nge i lungngaih dâwn le? I hriak ûmah hriak thun khat la, kal rawh. Bethlehem mi Jesaia hnênah ka tîr ang che. A fapate zînga mi lal tûr ka ruat diam tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Samuela chuan, “Engtin nge ka kal theih ang, Saulan a lo hriat chuan min that mai ang,” a ti a. Lalpa chuan, “Bâwngla kai la, ‘ Lalpa hnêna thil hlân tûrin ka lo kal a ni,’ ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thilhlannaah chuan Jesaia sâwm la; tichuan, i tih tûr chu ka hrilh ang che, a hming ka hrilh che chu hriak min thihsak dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Samuela chuan Lalpa thupêk ang chuan a ti a, Bethlehem-ah a kal ta a. Chumi khuaa upaho chuan khûr chungin an lo hmuak a, “Ṭha lam thu-a lo kal i ni em le?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ṭha lam thilah ni e, Lalpa hnêna thil hlân tûra lo kal ka ni. Intifai ula, thilhlannaah chuan lo kal ve rawh u,” a ti a. Jesaia leh a fapate chu a thian fai a, thilhlannaah chuan a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, an lo thlen chuan Eliaba chu ngun takin a en a, “ Lalpa hmaa ding hi a hriak thiha chu a ni phawt ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpan a hnênah, “A hmêl ṭhat lam emaw, a sân lam emaw en suh, ani hi chu ka duh lo. Lalpa chuan mihring thlîr dân angin a thlîr ve si lo; mihring chuan pâwn lam lan dân an en ṭhîn a, Lalpa erawh chuan thinlung lam a en ṭhîn” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Jesaian Abinadaba a ko leh a, Samuela hnênah a rawn hruai a, ani chuan, “Hei pawh hi Lalpa thlan a ni lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesaia chuan Sama a va kaltîr leh a, ani chuan, “Ani pawh hi Lalpa thlan chu a la ni chuang lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Jesaia chuan a fapa pasarihte chu a hmaah a inlantîr a, Samuela chuan Jesaia hnênah, “Hêngho hi Lalpa thlan an la ni ta lo cheu mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samuela chuan Jesaia hnênah, “I fate hetah an awm kim em?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “A tlum ber a la awm ve lo; tûnah hian berâm a vêng a ni,” a ti a. Samuela chuan Jesaia hnênah, “Va kohtîr rawh, a lo thlen hma chu inthawina kan hlân lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A va ko va, a hmaah a rawn hruai a. Ani chu sâr veng vawng, meng mawi tak, hmêlṭha tak a ni. Lalpa chuan, “Hriak thih rawh le, hei ngei hi a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samuela chuan a hriak ûm chu a la a, a unaute hmaah ani chu hriak a thih ta a. Chumi ni aṭang chuan Lalpa thlarau chu nasa takin Davida chungah a lo thleng ta a. Samuela chu a tho va, Rama khuaah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa thlarau chuan Saula chu a chhuahsan a, Lalpa tirh thlarau sualin ani chu a tibuai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saula chhiahhlawhte chuan a hnênah, “Ngai teh, Pathian tirh thlarau sualin a tibuai ta che a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka pu, i chhiahhlawh, i tirhkahte hi thu min pe la, ṭingṭang tum thiam kan zawnsak ang che, Pathian tirh thlarau sualin a man hunah che ani chuan ṭingṭang a tumsak ang che a; tichuan, i ṭha leh mai ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saula chuan a chhiahhlawhte hnênah chuan, “Chutiang tum thiam tak chu mi zawnsak ula, ka hnênah rawn hruai rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An zînga tlangvâl pakhat chuan a chhâng a, “Ngai teh, Bethlehem mi, Jesaia fapa, ṭingṭang tum thiam tak, mi huaisen, indo thiam, thu sawi thiam tak, hmêlṭha tak a awm a, a hnênah Lalpa chu a awm a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saula chuan Jesaia hnênah mi a tîr a, “I fapa, Davida, berâm vênga awm chu, han kaltîr rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesaia chuan sabengtung phur khat chhang leh uain bûr khat leh kêlno, Saula pêk atân a fapa Davida chu a kentîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Davida chu Saula hnênah chuan a va kal a, a bulah chuan a awm ta a. Saula chuan a lo ngaina hle a, a râlthuam kengtuah a ṭang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Saula chuan Jesaia hnênah, “Davida hi ka mit a tlung hle a; chuvângin, ka hnênah awm reng mai rawh se,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian tirh thlarau sualin Saula chu a man châng apiangin Davida chuan ṭingṭang a la a, a tumsak ṭhîn a, thlarau sual chuan a chhuahsan a, Saula chu a lo harhin a lo ṭha leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistia mite chuan indo tûrin an sipaite an khâwm a, Judai ram chhûng Soko khuaah an kal khâwm a. Efes-damim an tih hmun, Soko leh Azeka inkârah chuan ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saula leh Israel mite pawh an inpun khâwm a, Ela ruamah ṭanhmun an khuar a. Filistia mite lo dang tûrin an inzâr darh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Filistia mite chu tlângah an awm a, Israel-te pawh a râl lehlam tlângah an awm bawk a, an inkârah chuan ruam a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Filistia mite ṭanhmun aṭang chuan an mi chak Goliatha, Gath khuaa mi hi a lo chhuak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dâr lukhum a khum a, dâr âwmphaw a ha bawk a, a âwmphaw rih lam chu kg. sawmnga leh pasarih a ni a, tawng ruk leh khâp khata sâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ngalah chuan dâr ngalphaw a bun a, a dârah dârfei a pai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A fei ngul chu suk tiat a ni a, a fei lu chu kg. sariha rit a ni, a phaw kengtu chu a hmaah a kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ding a, Israel sipaiho chu a au va, an hnênah, “Indo tûra inep reng a ṭûl em ni? Kei Filistia mi ka ni a, nangni Saula chhiahhlawh in ni. In zîng ata mi thlang chhuak ula, ka hnênah lo chhuk teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Min hneha min tihhlum chuan in chhiahhlawh kan ni ang a, keiin ka ngama ka tihhlum chuan kan chhiahhlawh in ni ang a, kan bawihah in awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Filistia mi chuan, “Vawiin hian Israel-ho sipaite chu ka cho a ni, mi pakhat han thlang chhuak ula, kan lo inbei ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saula leh Israel mi zawng zawngin chu Filistia mi thu sawi chu an hriatin an zâm a, an hlau ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Davida chu Judai ram Bethlehem khua Efratha mi, Jesaia fapa a ni. Jesaia chuan fapa pariat a nei a, Saula a lo lal khân upa tak, tar tawh tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesaia fapa pathumin Saula chu indonaah an zui a. A fapa pathum indonaa kalte chu a upa ber Eliaba te, a dawttu Abinadaba te, a pathumna Sama te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Davida chu a naupang ber a ni a, a upa pathumte chuan Saula chu an zui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Davida chu Saula hnên aṭangin a pa berâm enkawlin Bethlehem-ah a va kal ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Filistia mi chuan ni tin, zîng leh tlaiah, a va pan a, ni sawmli chhûng a va intâr lang ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesaia chuan a fapa Davida hnênah, “Buhfai kan ro kg. sâwm leh chhang tlâwn sâwm keng la, i ûte riahhmuna awm va pe thuai rawh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, bâwnghnute khal tlang sâwm hi an pâwla sâng hotu kensak la, i ûte engtin nge an awm han zâwt la, an chanchin han hre ngei ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saula leh i ûte chu Israel mi zawng zawng nên Filistia mite beiin Ela ruamah an awm e.” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Davida chu zîng takah a tho va, berâm chu vêngtu pakhat kutah a hnutchhiah a, Jesaia thupêk ang chuan a keng a, a kal ta a. Indona hmun pana chhuak mêk sipaiho chu inbei tûra an lo au dur dur laiin ani chuan riahbûk chu a va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel-ho leh Filistia mite chu inbei tûrin an lo inzâr a, sipai leh sipai chu an lo inep ut mai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Davida chuan a thil ken chu bungraw enkawltu hnênah chuan a dah a, sipaiho zîngah chuan a va tlân a, a ûte chu chibai a va bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anni chu a biak laiin, ngai teh, an mi chak Gath khuaa Filistia mi, a hming Goliatha chu Filistia sipaiho zîng aṭang chuan a lo chhuak a, a thu sawi ngai bawk kha a han sawi a. Chu chu Davida chuan a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawngin chu mi chu an hmuhin an tlânsan a, an hlau êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel mite chuan, “Kha pa lo chhuak kha in hmu em? Israel mite cho tûra lo chhuak a nih ngei kha. Tu pawh amah tihlum chu lalin sum tam tak a pe ang a, a fanu a neihtîr bawk ang; tin, a pa chhûngte chuan Israel ramah chhiah an awl ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Davida chuan a kianga dingte hnênah chuan, “Israel-te tithlabârtu, he Filistia mi thattu hi eng lâwmman nge an pêk dâwn? Pathian nung sipaiho cho veitu, he serh tan loh Filistia mi hi tu nge maw a nih le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mite chuan an chhâng a, “A tihlumtu apiang chu kan sawi ang khân tihsak a ni ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, an u ber Eliaba chuan chutianga mi hnêna a thu sawi chu a lo hriatin Davida chungah a thin a ur ta hle a. “Engah nge i lo chhuk ve? Thlalêra berâm tlêm tê kha tu nge i vêntîr? I luhlul leh chapozia hi, indo en tûrin i lo kal mai mai a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Eng dang ti lo ve, thu ka zâwt a ni ve mai alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Davida chuan mi dang hnên lam a hawisan a, a sawi ngai bawk a sawi leh a, mite chuan a hmaa an chhân ang bawkin an chhâng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Davida thu sawi chu an hriatin Saula an hrilh a, ani chuan a ko ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Davida chuan Saula hnênah chuan, “He pa avâng hian tu mah zâm suh se, i chhiahhlawh hian he Filistia mi hi ka va bei ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Saula chuan Davida hnênah, “He Filistia mi hi bei tûrin i kal thei em lo vang a, i la naupang si a, ani zawng a tleirâwl lai ata indo mi a ni tawh asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Davida chuan Saula hnênah, “I chhiahhlawh hian ka pa berâm ka vêng ṭhîn a, sakeibaknei emaw, savawm emaw an lo kala berâm rual zîng ata berâmno an lâk te hian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />ka ûm ṭhîn a, ka bei a, an sa seh chu ka chhuhsak ṭhîn. Min rawn beih dâwnte hian an baksamah ka man a, ka ṭhuai a, ka that ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hian sakeibaknei leh savawmte ka that tawh a, he serh tan loh Filistia mi pawh hi chutiang chuan ka sawisa dâwn a ni, Pathian nung sipaite a cho vei a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan, “Sakeibaknei lak ata leh savawm lak ata min chhanchhuaktu Lalpa chuan Filistia mi lak ata chu min chhan chhuak ang,” a ti a. Saula chuan, “Kal ta che le, Lalpan ṭanpui che rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Saula chuan Davida chu ama râlthuam a bel a, dâr lukhum a khumtîr a, âwmphaw a hâktîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Davida chuan a phaw chungah khandaih a pai a, kal a han tum chhin a; chutiang chuan a la inthuam ngai si lo va. Davida chuan Saula hnênah, “Ka kalpui thei hauh lo mai a, hetiang hi ka la inbel ngai si lo va,” a ti a. Davida chuan a hlîp ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tichuan, tiang a la a, luitêa ṭiau lung panga a thlang a, a berâm vên iptêah chuan a ak a, virvawm chu a keng a, Filistia mi chu a pan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Filistia mi chu a lo kal a, Davida chu a rawn pan a, a phaw kengtu chu a hmaah a kal zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Filistia mi chu a han hawi a, Davida a han hmuh chuan a hmusit hle a; tleirâwl tê, sâr veng vawng a ni a, a zaidam hmêl hle bawk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Filistia mi chuan Davida hnênah, “Uicho em ka niha, engati nge tiang nêna min rawn pan le?” a ti a. Filistia mi chuan a pathiante chhâlin Davida chu ânchhia a lawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Filistia mi chuan Davida hnênah, “Lo kal teh, i sate kha chunglêng savate leh ramsate ka han eitîr teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Davida chuan Filistia mi hnênah chuan, “Khandaih te, thal te, fei te kengin i lo thawk a; kei zawng Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, i chova hmingin ka lo thawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Vawiinah hian Lalpan nang hi ka kutah min pe a ni; ka that ang che a, i lu ka tansak ang che, Filistia sipai ruangte chu vawiin hian chunglêng savate leh ramsate ka pe ang a; tichuan, mi zawng zawngin Israel-te zîngah Pathian a chêng reng a ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Indona hneh nân Lalpa chuan khandaih leh fei, hmanruaah a hmang chuang lo tih heta pung khâwm zawng zawngin an hria ang; ani chuan nangniho hi ka kutah min pe dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Filistia mi chu Davida bei tûra a lo kal hnaih lai chuan Davida chu inbeihna hmun lam panin Filistia mi chu tâwk tûrin a tlan vat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Davida chuan a ip a zen a, lung a han phawrh a, a virvawm chuan a han vawm a, Filistia mi chu a chaldârah tak a fuh a, lung chu a chalah a lût a, bawkkhupin a tlu ta dêr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Davida chuan Filistia mi chu virvawm leh lungin a bei a, Filistia mi chu a vawm a, a that ta a. Davida chuan khandaih a keng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Davida chu a tlân a, Filistia mi kiangah chuan a va ding a, a khandaih chu a pai ata a phawisak a, a lu a tansak ta a. Filistia mite chuan an mi chak a thi tih an hriat chuan an tlânchhe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Israel mite leh Juda mite erawh chu an tho va, an au va, Filistia mite chu Gath leh Ekron kulh kawngkhâr thleng rawkin an ûm ta a. Filistia mi, hliam tuarte chu Saraim aṭanga Gath leh Ekron thlengin kawng tluanin an tlu rum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Israel mite chuan Filistia mite an ûm chu an kîrsan a, an riahhmun chu an suam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Davida chuan Filistia mi lu chu a la a, Jerusalem-ah a kalpui a, a râlthuam erawh chu a puan inah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Filistia mi bei tûra Davida a kal lai chu Saulan a lo hmu a, a sipaihotu Abnera hnênah, “Abner, he tlangvâl hi tu fa nge?” a ti a. Abnera chuan, “Aw lalber, ka lo hre hauh lo mai a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Lal chuan, “He naupang hi tu fa nge a nih zâwt chhuak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Davida chuan Filistia mi a that haw chu Abnera chuan a hruai a, Filistia mi lu keng chungin Saula hnênah a kalpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Saula chuan a hnênah, “Tlangvâl, tu fapa nge i nih?” a ti a. Davida chuan a chhâng a, “I chhiahhlawh Jesaia, Bethlehem mi fapa ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davidan Saula a biak hnu chuan Jonathana leh Davida chu an inngaina ta hle a. Jonathana chuan amah tlukin ani chu a hmangaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chumi ni aṭang chuan Saula chuan a hnênah a awmtîr a, a pa hnênah a hawntîr phal ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jonathana chuan amah ang chiaha a hmangaih avângin Davida nên chuan thu an thlung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathana chuan a thuam inbel lai a hlîp a, Davida a pe a, a âwmphaw te, a ngûnhnâm te, a thal te, a kâwnghrên te nên lam a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Davida chu Saulan a tirhna lam apiangah a kal a, a hlawhtlin zêl avângin a sipaihotu pakhatah a dah a. Chu chu mi zawng zawng ngaihah leh Saula sipaihote ngaihah pawh tih âwm tak a ni rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Davidan Filistia mi a thah hnu khân an lo haw a, Israel khawpui tin aṭangin hmeichheho hla saa lâm chungin, benchhek leh perhkhuang tumin hlim takin Saula hmuak tûrin an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmeichhiate chuan lâm chungin hlain an inchhâwn a, “Saulan sâng tam tak a that a, Davidan sîng tam tak a that,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An hla sak chuan Saula chu a tithinur ta hle a, “Davida chu sîng thattu an ti a, kei sâng chauh thattu min ti a, hetiang a nih chuan ka ram hi a chang mai dâwn alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi ni aṭang chuan Saula chuan Davida chu a îtsîk ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Pathian tirh thlarau sualin ina Saula awm chu a man ta a, a ṭawng ta bual bual a. Davida chuan ni dang ang bawkin ṭingṭang a tum a, Saula chuan a fei chu a hûm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saula chuan a fei a lek a, “Bangah sâwn Davida hi ka khawh bet tlat teh ang,” a ti a. Davida chu ṭum hnih a kiang hman a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chu Davida hnênah a awm avângin Saulan a hlau ta hle a, ani lah chu Lalpan a kalsan tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Saula chuan ani chu a sawn bo va, a sipai sâng chunga hotu-ah a dah a, sipai zîngah Davida chu a khawsa ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpan a awmpui zêl avângin Davida chu a thiltih apiangah a hmuingîl zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saulan chu chu a hriatin a hlau lehzual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mite leh Juda mite erawh chuan a thil tih apiangah a kaihhruai zêl ṭhin avângin Davida chu an ngaina hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saula chuan Davida hnênah, “Ka fanu upa zâwk Merabi hi nupui atân ka pe ang che, huaisen takin min ṭan la, Lalpa tân bei zêl ang che,” a ti a. Saula chuan, “Ka kut tuar lovin Filistia mite kut tuar zâwk rawh se,” a ti rilru a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Davida chuan Saula hnênah, “Tu nge maw ka niha, Israel rama ka pa chhûngte pawh eng mi nge an niha lal mâkpa ka han nihna tûr chu le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saula fanu Merabi chu Davida neihtîr a lo hun chuan Meholat mi Adriela nupui atân a pe ta thên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saula fanu Mikali chuan Davida chu a hmangaih hle a. Saula an hrilh a, chu thu chuan a tilâwm hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saula chuan, “A awhna thang atân leh Filistia mite kut a tuar theih nân ani hi ka pe teh ang,” a ti a. Saula chuan Davida hnênah “Tûnah chuan ka mâkpa i ni tawh ang,” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Saula chuan a chhiahhlawh a tîr a, “Davida chu a rûk têin bia ula, lal hi i chungah a lâwm hle a, a chhiahhlawh zawng zawng pawhin an ngaina che a, tûnah chuan lal mâkpa i ni tawh ngei ang,” tiin a hrilhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Mi rethei leh tu ma ngaihsân hlawh lo, keini ang tâna lal mâkpa han nih chu tih rual em ni ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saula chhiahhlawhte chuan Davida chhân dân chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saula chuan, “Davida hnênah hetiangin sawi rawh u, ‘Lal chuan a hmêlma phuba lâk nân Filistia mite serh vun za tih loh chu a fanu man atân eng mah a la duh lo’ ti rawh u,” a ti a. Saula chuan Filistia mite kuta thihtîr a tum tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A chhiahhlawhten chu thu chu Davida an han hrilh chuan lal mâkpa a ni tûr chu a lâwm hle a. Hun tiam chu a la thleng rih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Davida chu a mite nên an vâk chhuak ta a, Filistia mi zahnih an va that a, an serh vunte chu Davida te chuan an rawn hâwn a; tin, lal mâkpa a nih theihna tûr chuan kim takin an pe ta a. Saula chuan a fanu Mikali chu nupuiah a neihtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Saula chuan Davida hnênah Lalpa chu a awm reng tih a hre chiang ta a, a fanu Mikali chuan Davida chu a duh hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Saula chuan Davida chu a hlau ta tawlh tawlh a, a dam chhûng zawngin Saula chu Davida hmêlma a ni ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Filistia sipaiten an rawn beih châng apiangin Davida chu Saula sipai hotute aiin a che ṭhain a hlawhtling ṭhîn a, a hming chu a lo thang ta hle a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saula chuan a fapa Jonathana leh a chhiahhlawh zawng zawng chu Davida that tûrin a ti a. Nimahsela, Saula fapa Jonathana chuan Davida chu a hmangaih hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jonathana chuan Davida hnênah, “Ka pa hian thah a tum che a; chuvângin, naktûk zîngah chuan fîmkhur la, hmun fianrialah biru la; tah chuan awm rêng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ka pa chu ka hruai chhuak ang a, i bihrûkna lam phûlah kan lo kal ang a, i chungchâng ka sawipui ang a, kan inbiak dân chu ka hrilh leh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathana chuan a pa Saula kiangah chuan Davida chu a va fak a, a hnênah, “lalber, i chhiahhlawh Davida chungah chuan thil sual ti lul suh. I chungah eng mah a tisual lo va, i tân thil ṭha hlîr a ti zâwk ṭhîn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thih huamin Filistia mi kha a bei a, Israel mi zawng zawng tân Lalpan hnehna a siamsak a; chu chu nang pawhin i hmu a, i lâwm hle kha. Eng vângin nge pawi khawih awm lova Davida chu i thah mai ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saula chuan Jonathana thu sawi chu a pawm a, “Davida chu ka that lo vang,” tiin Lalpa hming chhâlin thu a tiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jonathana chuan Davida chu a ko va, chûng thil zawng zawng chu a hrilh a. Tichuan, Davida chu Saula hnênah a hruai a, tûn hma ang khân a hnênah a awm leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Indona a lo awm leh a, Davida chu a thawk chhuak a, Filistia mite chu a va bei a, a that chiam a, a hmaah chuan an tlânchhe ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saula chu ama fei kenga a ṭhut laiin Lalpa tirh thlarau sual a chungah a lo thleng leh a; chutih lai chuan Davida chuan ṭingṭang a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saula chuan Davida chu bangah feia khawh beh tlat a tum a; mahse, Davida chu a kiang hman a, fei chu bangah chuan a khawh bûr ta ngur a. Davida chu a tlân chhuak a, a him ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saula chuan Davida chu a ina va huala, a tûk zînga that tûrin mi a tîr a. Davida nupui Mikali chuan, “Zânina i tlân chhuah loh chuan naktûkah an that dâwn che a ni,” tiin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Mikali chuan Davida chu tukverhah a thlâk thla a, a tlân chhuak a, a him ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mikali chuan milem a la a, khumah a zalh a, a lû lamah kêl hmul lukham a dah a, puanin a khuh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Davida hruai tûra Saula mi tirhte hnênah chuan, “A dam lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saula chuan Davida va en tûrin mi a tîr leh a, “A khum chawpin han zâwn ula, ka lo that ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi tirhte chu an va luh chuan, ngai teh, milem chu a lu lama kêl hmul lukhamin a lo mu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saulan Mikali hnênah, “Engtizia nge hetianga mi buma, ka hmêlma chu i tlân chhuahtîr le?” a ti a. Mikali chuan, “Ka kaltîr loh chuan mi thah a tum si alâwm,” tiin Saula chu a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Davida chu a tlânchhia a, a him ta a. Rama khuaah Samuela hnênah a va kal a, a chunga Saula thil tih dân zawng zawng chu a hrilh a. Tin, Samuela nên chuan Naioth-ah an kal a, tah chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saula hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh, Davida chu Rama khuaa Naioth-ah a awm,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saula chuan Davida man tûrin mi a tîr a. Zâwlnei rual thu sawi dual dual Samuelan a hruai lai chu an va hmu a, Saula mi tirhte pawh chuan thu an sawi ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chu thu chu Saula an hrilh a, mi dang a tîr leh a, chung mite pawh chuan thu an sawi ve leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ani pawh chu Rama khaw lamah chuan a kal ve ta a; Seku hmuna tuichhunchhuah lian tak a va thlen chuan, “Samuela leh Davida hi khawiah nge an awm?” a ti a. Mi pakhat hian, “Ngai teh, Rama khuaa Naioth-ah an awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, Naioth-ah chuan a va kal a, Pathian thlarau a chungah a lo thleng ve ta a, Rama khuaa Naioth a thlen thlengin thu a sawi ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A silhfênte a hlîp a, Samuela hmaah chuan thu a sawi ve ta a. Chumi ni chuan nilêng leh zankhuain saruakin a awm a; chuta ṭang chuan, “Saula pawh zâwlnei a ni ve ta elo?” tih hi an chîng hlen ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida chu Rama khuaa Naioth aṭang chuan a tlân chhuak a, Jonathana hnênah a kal a, “Eng nge ka tih a, eng nge ka bawhchhiat le? I pa chungah eng nge ka tihsuala hetia mi thah a tum mai le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani chuan, “A that tawp lo vang che, i thi hauh lo vang. Ngai teh, ka pa chuan thil lian emaw, thil tê emaw min hrilh lovin eng mah a ti ngai lo. Engah tehlul nge hêng thu hi ka hnênah a zêp ang? A zêp hauh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Nangin min hmangaihzia hi i pa chuan a hre chiang hle a; chuvângin, i rilru tihnat a hlauh avângin ‘He ka thiltih tum hi chu hre suh se,’ a ti a ni ang. Nimahsela, Lalpa nunna leh i nunna chhâlin ka hrilh a che, tlêmah tlêmah ka thi lo chauh a ni,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathana chuan Davida hnênah, “I duh apiang chu ka tihsak zêl ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Davida chuan Jonathana hnênah, “Ngai teh, naktûk hi thla thar tûk a ni dâwn a, lal hnêna chaw kîl ngei tûr ka ni a; mahse, ni thum ni tlai lam thlengin phûlah biru tûrin ka kal ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, i pain ka awm lo a ni tih a hre ta a nih chuan, ‘Davida chuan an khua Bethlehem-ah an chhûngkuaa an kum tin thilhlan hlân tûrin kal min dîl ngawih ngawih a, a kal ta a ni,’ ti la;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ani, a ṭha alâwm a tih chuan i chhiahhlawha tân a muanawm ang a, a thinrim erawh chuan ka chungah thil ṭha lo tih a tum tih hria ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hi khawngaih rawh, Lalpa hmaah thu i thlunpui si a; ka lo bawhchhia a nih chuan nangman min that mai rawh; engah nge i pa hnênah chuan min hlan kher ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jonathana chuan, “Chutiang chu ring rêng rêng suh, ka pain i chungah thil ṭha lo tih a tum ka hriat phawt chuan ka hrilh loh che i ring em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Davida chuan Jonathana hnênah, “I pain bung takin a chhâng che tih tuin nge min hrilh ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jonathana chuan Davida hnênah, “Hawh teh, phûlah sâwn i kal teh ang,” a ti a. Tichuan, phûlah chuan an va kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jonathana chuan Davida hnênah, “Israel-te Pathian Lalpa chu thuhretu ni rawh se, naktûk hetih hunah hian emaw, a tûk lehah emaw, ka pa ka han dâwp vêl ang a, i chungchâng ṭha taka a sawi chuan mi ka rawn tîr ang a, ka rawn hrilh ngei ngei ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka pain i chungah thil ṭha lo tih a tum tih ka hriata, ka rawn hrilh lo che a nih phawt chuan Lalpa chuan a tih tihin min ti sela, chutiang thil ṭha lo chu ka chungah ti ve rawh se. Him taka i awm theihna kawng ka zawnsak ngei ngei ang che. Lalpa chu ka pa hnêna a awm ṭhîn angin i hnênah pawh awm zêl rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka damchhûng zawng Lalpa angin ka chungah ngilneihna tilang zêl la;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ka thiha Lalpan Davida hmêlmate lei ata a tibo vek a nih pawhin, ka chhûngte chu i lo khawngaih kumkhua dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jonathana chuan Davida chhûngte tân pawh thu a thlung tel a, “ Lalpa chuan tu pawh Davida chunga thil sual ti chu hrem zêl rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jonathana chuan amah a inhmangaih angin Davida chu a hmangaih a, chutianga amah chu hmangaih ve tûrin Davida chu a tiamtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jonathana chuan a hnênah, “Naktûk hi thla thar a ni a, i ṭhut hmun a ruah dâwn avângin i awm loh a lang ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Naktûk tûklehah chuan hmâna i bihrûkna hmunah khân biru leh la, lungpui phênah khân awm reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Inthemthiam ni âwm takin a sîrah thal pathum ka rawn kâp ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ‘Kal la, thal va chhar rawh,’ tiin naupang ka rawn tîr ang a; naupang hnênah, ‘En teh, thal chu i sîrah khân a awm; kal la, la rawh’ ka tih chuan i tân a muanawm a, hlauh tûr a awm lo tih Lalpa chhâlin ka sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, naupang hnênah, ‘En teh, thalte chu i piah lamah sâwn a awm’ ka tih chuan kal bo vang che, Lalpa chuan a kal botîr che a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, nang nêna kan sawi dun tâk chungchângah chuan Lalpa chu thuhretu ni kumkhua rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chu phûlah chuan a biru a, thla a lo thar chuan lal chuan chawhlui a rawn kîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lal chu ni danga a ṭhutna ngai bang bulah chuan a ṭhu a, Jonathana chu a hma zâwnah a ṭhu a. Abnera chu Saula kiangah a ṭhu a, Davida ṭhuthmun erawh chu a ruak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Saula chuan eng mah a sawi rih lo. ‘Eng emaw thiam lohna a nei a ni ang a’ a ti rilru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thla thar ni hnih ni chuan Davida ṭhuthmun a la ruak ta cheu va. Saula chuan a fapa Jonathana hnênah, “Engati nge Jesaia fapa Davida hi niminah leh vawiinah chawhlui kîl tûra a lo kal loh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jonathana chuan Saula chu a chhâng a, “Davida chuan Bethlehem-a kal mi dîl ngawih ngawih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />‘Min kaltîr hrâm rawh, khuaah chuan kan chhûngkuain inthawina kan hlân dâwn a, ka unaupain chuta awm ve ngei tûr chuan min ti si a; chuvângin, min khawngaih la, min kaltîr hrâm rawh, ka unaute ka va tlawh ang e,’ a ti a; chuvângin, lal chaw kîl tûrin a lo kal lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Saula chu Jonathana chungah chuan a thinur ta thut a, “Nang hmeichhe lepchiah leh luhlul fapa, i mualpho nân i nu a hringtu che tizak tûrin Jesaia fapa hi i ṭan tih ka hre chiang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesaia fapa hi a dam chhûng chuan nang leh kan ram hi a ding chhuak dâwn lo tih hre ta che; tûnah, mi kohtîr la, ka hnênah han hruai rawh, a thi ngei tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Eng vânga thi tûr nge a nih, eng nge a tihsual?” tiin Jonathana chuan a pa chu a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tichuan, Saula chuan khawh hlum tumin a tin a, a pa chuan Davida chu thah a lo tum ngei a ni tih a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jonathana chuan thinur takin a chaw kil chu a thawhsan a, chumi thla thar ni hnih ni chuan chaw chu a ei duh ta lo, a pain Davida a tihmualpho nasat êm avângin a rilru a na hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Jonathana chu naupang hruaiin phûl lamah Davida nêna an hmun ruatah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A naupang hruai hnênah, “Tlân la, ka thal kahte kha va zawng rawh,” a ti a. Naupang tlân lai chuan a piah lamah thal a kâp leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Naupangin Jonathana thal kahna hmun a va thlen chuan Jonathanan naupang chu a au va, “Thal chu i piah lamah khân a awm lo maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jonathana chuan naupang chu a au va, “Hmanhmawh la, kal thuai thuai la, muang suh,” a ti a. Jonathana hruai naupang chuan thalte chu a va chhar a, a pu hnênah chuan a rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Naupang chuan eng mah a hre lo va, Jonathana leh Davida erawh chuan thil kalhmang chu an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jonathana chuan naupang hnênah a thalte chu a pe a, “Kal ta la, khuaah hâwnpui rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Naupang chu a kal liam veleh Davida chu a bihrûkna lung phên aṭang chuan a lo chhuak a, bawkkhupin vawi thum chibai a rawn bûk a; tin, an infâwp a, an ṭap dûn ta a. Davida chu a lung a chhe lehzual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jonathana chuan Davida hnênah, “Thlamuang takin kal rawh aw, nang nêna kan inṭhianna chu Lalpa hminga thu kan thlun tawh kha. Lalpa chu nang nêna kan inkârah te, i thlahte leh ka thlahte inkârah te, thuhretu ni kumkhua rawh se,” a ti a. Davida chu a tho va, a kal ta a, Jonathana pawh khuaah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida chu Nob khaw puithiam Ahimeleka hnênah a kal a. Ahimeleka chuan khûr chungin Davida chu a lo hmuak a, a hnênah, “Engtizia nge tu mah hruai lova i lo kal le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Davida chuan puithiam Ahimeleka hnênah chuan, “Lalin tih tûr min tuk a, ka hnênah, ‘Ka tirhna che leh tih tûr ka tuk che hi tu mah hrilh suh,’ a ti tlat a. Tlangvâlte nên kan thiltih tûr leh kan tihna hmun tûr kan ruat diam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tûnah, engte nge i neih le? Chhang tlang nga min pe la, thil dang i neih apiang pawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Puithiam chuan Davida chu a chhâng a. “Chhang panga chu ka nei lo va, chhang thianghlim chauh ka nei; tlangvâlte chu hmeichhe lakah an thianghlim emaw chu?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Davida chuan, puithiam chu a chhâng a, “Kan rammut dâwn apiangin tlangvâlho chu hmeichhe lakah an intibawlhhlawh ngai lo; tûnah lek phei hi chuan an intihbawlhhlawh loh tûrzia mai chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, puithiam chuan chhang thianghlim chu a pe ta a, chutah chuan Pathian hnêna an hlan chauh lo chu chhang dang a awm si lo va; Lalpa hnêna an hlan chhang hlui chu ni tin chhang tharin an thlâk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Saula chhiahhlawh pakhat a awm ve a, ani chu Lalpa hnêna thutiam nei lai mêk a ni. A hming chu Doega a ni: Edom mi, Saula ran rual veng hotu ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Davida chuan Ahimeleka hnênah, “Fei emaw, khandaih emaw i kawl lo maw? Lalin hmanhmawh taka min tirh avângin ka khandaih leh ka hriamhrei, a eng mah ka rawn keng hman ta lo va ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puithiam chuan, “Filistia mi, Ela ruama i thaha khandaih chu en teh, puithiam kawr phênah hian tuamin a awm reng mai. Chu chu i duh chuan la rawh, chu lo chu hetah eng mah dang a awm lo,” a ti a. Davida chuan, “Chu lo liam, min pe mai rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chu a tho va, chumi ni chuan Saula hlauvin a tlân bo va, Gath lal Akisa hnênah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Akisa chhiahhlawhte chuan a hnênah, “He mi hi an ram lal Davida kha a ni lâwm ni? ‘Saulan sâng tam tak a that a, Davidan sîng tam tak’ tia lâm chunga hlaa an awih kha a ni lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hêng thu avâng hian Davida chu a râlṭi ta a, Gath lal Akisa chu a hlau hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, an mit hmuhah a awm dân a tidanglam a, an hmaah a â der ta chiam a. Kawngkhârte a ham vak vak a, a chilthli chu a khabehmulahte a luang duah duah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Akisa chuan a chhiahhlawhte hnênah, “En teh u, he mi hi mi â a nih hre reng chungin engati nge ka hnêna in rawn hruai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi â tlachham min tih vâng em ni he mi hi ka hmaah âtso tûra in rawn hruai? He mi hi ka inah a lo lût ang maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan Davida chu a chhuak a, Adulam pûkah a awm ta a. A unaute leh a pa chhûngten chu chu an hriatin an zu fin ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hnehchhiah tuar te, lei bat nei te, lungawi lote chuan an rawn bêl a, an hotu-ah a ṭang ta a. Tichuan, mi zali lai a hnênah chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan Davida chu Moab rama Mizpa-ah a kal a, Moab lal hnênah chuan, “Pathianin eng nge min tihsak dâwn tih ka hriat hma chuan ka nu leh ka pate hi i hnênah lo awm rawh se aw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, anni chu Moab lal hnênah chuan a hnutchhiah a, pûk hima Davida a awm chhûng chu chutah chuan an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zâwlnei Gada chuan Davida hnênah, “Pûkah hi chuan awm reng suh; chhuak la, Judai ramah kal rawh,” a ti a. Davida chu a chhuak a, Heret ngâwah a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saula chuan Davida awmna an hre ta tih a lo hria a. Chutih lai chuan Saula chu Gibea khuaah a awm a, tlâng panga Esel thing hnuaiah a fei kengin a ṭhu a, a ṭhuihruai zawng zawng chu a kiangah an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saula chuan a kianga ding a ṭhuihruaite hnênah chuan, “Nangni Benjamin mite u, ngaithla rawh u. Jesaia fapa chuan lo te, grep huante pe che uin za hotu-ah te, sâng hotu-ah te a siam vêk dâwn che u em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In vaiin min phiar a ni lâwm ni? Ka fapain Jesaia fapa thu a thlunpui thu tu mahin min hrilh lo va, tu mahin pawi min tihpui hek lo. Ka fapain ka chhiahhlawh Davida hi mi do tûr leh vawiinah pawh min châng ru tûrin a fuih thu hi tu mahin in sawi duh si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Edom mi, Doega, Saula chhiahhlawh zînga ding ve chuan a chhâng a: “Jesaia fapa chu Nob khuaah, Ahituba fapa Ahimeleka hnêna a lo kal ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan Lalpa a râwnsak a, ei tûr a pe a, Filistia mi Goliatha ngûnhnâm a pe bawk a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lal chuan puithiam Ahimeleka, Ahituba fapa leh a pa chhûngkua, Nob khuaa puithiam zawng zawng chu a kohtîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Saula chuan, “Ahituba fapa tûnah ngaithla rawh,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Eng nge ni ka pu?” tiin a chhang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Saula chuan a hnênah, “Engati nge nang leh Jesaia fapa hian min phiar le? Chhang leh khandaih i pe a. Pathian i râwnsak a; chuvângin, min do va, vawiinah hetiangin min châng ta a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahimeleka chuan lal chu a chhâng a, “Lal mâkpa, vêngtu hotu, in chhûngkaw chawimawitu leh i chhiahhlawhte zînga mi rinawm ber Davida ang hi tu nge awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vawiin hi Pathian ka râwnsak ni hmasa ber em ni? A ni lo, lal chuan a chhiahhlawh hi ka pa chhûngte nên nangmah phiarruah min puh lo hrâm rawh. I chhiahhlawh hian hêng thil hi a eng mah ka hre lo tak meuh a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Ahimelek, i thi ngei tûr a ni, nang leh i pa chhûngte zawng zawng nên,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a kianga vêngtu sipai dingte hnênah chuan, “Kal ula, Lalpa puithiamte hi that rawh u; Davida lamah an ṭang a, a tlân bo tih hre reng sia ka hnêna an sawi loh avângin,” a ti a. Nimahsela, vêngtu sipaite chuan Lalpa puithiamte chungah kut an thlâk duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal chuan Doega hnênah, “Kal la, puithiamte chu va that rawh,” a ti a. Edom mi Doega chu a kal a, puithiamte chu a va bei a, chumi ni chuan puithiam kawr ha chin sawmriat leh panga a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, puithiam khua Nob chu khandaihin a bei a, a hmei a pa, naupang hnute hne lai lamin, bâwng te, sabengtung te, berâm te nên lam khandaihin a sât hlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahimeleka fate zînga Ahitupa fapa, Abiathara chu a tlân chhuak a, Davida hnênah a tlan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abiathara chuan Lalpa puithiamte Saulan a thah thu chu Davida a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Davida chuan Abiathara hnênah, “Khami nia Doega ka hmuh khân, Saula a hrilh ang tih ka ring rêng a ni. I pa chhûngte zawng zawng chu keimah avânga thi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka hnênah awm la, hlau suh, mi thah tumtu chuan nang pawh thah a tum che a ni, ka hnêna i awm chuan i him ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Filistia miten Keila khua an bei a, hruihzâwla an buhte an lâksak vek mai,” tiin Davida chu an rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani chuan Lalpa hnênah, “Hêng Filistia mite hi ka zuk bei ang em?” tiin a zâwt a. Lalpa chuan, “Kal la, Filistia mite chu bei la, Keila khua chu chhan chhuak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Davida mite chuan a hnênah, “Judai ram aṭang pawhin kan hlau a ni a, Keila khuaa zuk kala, Filistia sipaiho zuk beih chu a va hlauhawm lehzual âwm ve?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Davida chuan Lalpa chu a râwn leh a, Lalpa chuan a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Keila khuaah chuan chhuk rawh, Filistia mite chu i kutah ka pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Davida leh a mite chu Keila khuaah chuan an kal ta a, Filistia mite chu an zuk bei a, an rante an lâksak a, an that chiam a; chutiang chuan Keila khuaa mite chu Davida chuan a chhan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahimeleka fapa Abiathara chu Keila khuaa Davida hnênah chuan puithiam kawr kengin a tlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Keila khuaah Davida a kal tih Saula an hrilh a, Saula chuan, “Pathianin ka kutah min pe ta a nih chu; kulh kawngka kalhna nei khuaah amah a inkhung ta si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saula chuan mi zawng zawng, Keila khua zuk beia Davida leh a hote hual tûrin a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saulan beih a tum tih Davida chuan a lo hria a, puithiam Abiathara hnênah, “Puithiam kawr kha han la teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Aw Lalpa Israel-te Pathian, Saula chuan kei i chhiahhlawh avâng hian Keila khuaa lo kala, rawn tihchhiat vek a tum tih ka lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keila khuaa mite hian a kutah min pe dâwn em? I chhiahhlawhin ka lo hriat ang hian Saula chu a lo chhuk dâwn em? Aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, hei hi min hrilh teh,” a ti a. Lalpa chuan, “Lo kal a tum,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Davida chuan a zâwt leh a, “Keila mite hian kei leh ka hote hi Saula kutah min pe ang em?” a ti a. Lalpa chuan, “An pe dâwn che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Davida leh a hote, mi zaruk emaw lai chu an tho va, Keila khua ata chu a remchânna lai apiangah an chhuak ta a. Davida chu Keila khua ata a tlân chhuak ta tih Saulan a hriat chuan Keila khuaa kal chu a tum ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Davida chu Zif tlângram thlalêrah chuan a rawl a, a awm ta reng a. Saula chuan ni tin a zawng a; Pathianin a kutah a pe lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Davida chu Zif thlalêr Hores hmuna a awm lai chuan amah thah tumin Saula a lo thawk tih a hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Saula fapa Jonathana chu a lo thawk a, Davida hnênah Hores-ah chuan a lo kal a. “Pathianin a vêng zêl dâwn che a ni,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A hnênah chuan, “Hlau rêng rêng suh, ka pa Saula chuan i chungah kut a thlâk lo vang. Israel lalah i ṭang ang a, kei i dawttu ka ni ang, ka pa pawhin chu chu a hria a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An pahnih chuan Lalpa hmaah thu an thlung a, Jonathana chu in lamah a hâwng a, Davida erawh chu ramhnuaiah a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zif mite chuan Gibea khuaah Saula chu an han hmu a, a hnênah, “Davida chu Hakila tlângram, Jesimon chhim lam Hores hmunah kan bul maiah a awm reng alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tûnah, aw lalpa, lo chhuk la, i duhthusâm ang takin ani chu lal kutah kan lo hlân mai tûr alâwm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saula chuan, “Mi in ṭanpui ṭhin avângin Lalpa chuan mal sâwm che u rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kal ta ula, va hre chiang lehzual rawh u. Khawi lamah nge a kal ṭhina, tu nge chutah chuan hmu ṭhîn va zawng chhuak rawh u, mi bum a thiam hle tih ka hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A bihrûkna ṭhinte zawng chhuak vek ula; tichuan, engkim hre chiangin ka hnênah lo kîr leh ang che u. Tin, in rualin ka lo kal ve ang a, chu lai rama a la awm phawt chuan Juda hnam tam tak zîng aṭangin ani chu ka man chhuak ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, an tho va, Saula kal hmain Zif-ah chuan an kal a, Davida leh a mite chu Jesimon chhim Araba rama Maon thlalêrah chuan an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saula leh a mite chuan an zawng ṭan ta a, chu thu chu Davida an hrilh a; tichuan, Maon thlalêr lungpui hmunah a chhuk a, chutah chuan a awm ta reng a. Chu chu Saulan a lo hriat chuan Maon thlalêr lamah Davida chu a ûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Saula chuan tlâng pang lehlam kawngṭum a zawh a, Davida leh a hote chu chu tlâng pang lehlam kawngah Saula hlauvin hmanhmawh takin an kal a. Saula leh a hote chuan Davida leh a hote chu an man teuh hle tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zualko pakhat hi Saula hnênah a lo kal a, “Rang takin lo haw rawh, Filistia miten ram an rûn e,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Saulan Davida a ûm chu a kîr a, Filistia mite bei tûrin a kal ta a. Chuvângin, he hmun hi Sela-hamalekot an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan a chho va, Engedi hmunah a biru ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saulan Filistia mite a ûm chu a lo haw chuan, “Ngai teh, Davida chu Engedi thlalêrah a awm e,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saula chuan Israel mi sângthum a thlan chhuahte nên chuan sathâr chênna lungpui hmuna Davida leh a hote awm chu a zawng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An kalna kawng sirah chuan berâm huang a lo awm a. Chutah chuan pûk a awm, Saula chu inthiar tûrin a va lût a, Davida leh a hote chu pûk chhûngril lamah chuan an lo awm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Davida hote chuan, “ Lalpan i hnêna a sawi, ‘Ngai teh, i hmêlma chu i kutah ka pe ang che, a chungah ṭha i tih angin ti ang che,’ a tih kha a lo thleng ta a nih hi,” an ti a. Davida chu a tho va, a rûk têin Saula kawrfual hmâwr chu a va hlep a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Davida chuan Saula kawrfual hmâwr a hleh avâng chuan a inthiam lo hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hote hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa hriakthih, ka pu chunga kut ka lo lek hi ka tih loh tawp tûr ka lo ti a ni; ani chu Lalpa hriakthih a ni ngei si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Davida chuan hêng thu hian a mite chu a thlêm dai a, Saula beih chu a remti ta lo va. Saula pawh chu a tho va, pûk aṭang chuan a chhuak a, a kal leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Davida pawh chu a lo tho va, pûk aṭang chuan a lo chhuak a, “Lalpa, ka lalpa,” tiin Saula chu a au zui a, Saula chu a lo hawi a, Davida chuan bawkkhupin zah takin chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Davida chuan Saula hnênah, “Ngai teh, ‘Davidan i chhiatna a zawng a ni,’ tia miten i hnêna an sawi chu engah nge i awih ṭhin le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai teh, vawiin hian he pûk chhûng ngeiah hian Lalpan ka kutah a hlân che tih nangmah ngeiin i hria. That tûr chein mi ṭhenkhatin min nawr a; mahse, ka zuah che a ni. ‘Ka lalpa chungah kut ka thlâk lo vang, Lalpa hriakthih a ni si a;’ ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />En teh, ka pu, i puan fêm ka ken reng hi, i puanfêm pawh ka hlep ngei a; mahse, ka that duh lo che a ni; i chungah ka hel lo va, thil sual tih pawh ka nei hek lo. Thah tumin min zawng mah la, kei chuan i chungah thil sual tih ka duh lo tih hria ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan nang nêna kan inkâr thu hi rêl sela, kei zawngin i chungah kut ka thlâk dâwn lo, Lalpa chuan i lakah phuba la zâwk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hmânlai thufingin, ‘Mi sualin thil sual an ti ṭhîn,’ a ti a; kei chuan i chungah kut ka thlâk lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel lal chu tu beih tumin nge a lo chhuah? Tu nge i ûm le, ui thisâwn nge uihli?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan nang nêna kan inkâr thu rêl sela, tifel rawh se. Ka chungthu hi ngaihvenin mi sawipui sela, i kut ata mi chhan chhuak rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng thu chu Davidan Saula hnêna a sawi zawhin Saula chuan, “Ka fapa David, i aw a ni maw?” a ti a, ring takin a ṭap chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Davida hnênah chuan, “Kei ai chuan i fel zâwk daih a ni, nang chuan ka chungah thil ṭha i ti a, kei erawh chuan thil ṭha lo ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vawiin hian ka chunga i ṭhatzia i tilang ta, Lalpan i kuta min pêk pawhin min that duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Miin a hmêlma hmu fuh sela, a khawih duh lo vang em ni? Vawiina ka chunga i thil tih dânah hian Lalpa chuan thil ṭhain rûl che rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai teh, lal i la ni ngei dâwn a, Israel-te lalram chu i kutah tihngheh a la ni ngei dâwn tih ka hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka thlahte tiboral lo tûr leh ka pa chhûngkaw zîng ata ka hming thai bo lo tûrin tûnah Lalpa hming chhâlin chhia chham rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chuan Saula hnênah chhia a chham a; Saula chu in lamah a hâwng a, Davida leh a hote chu an bihrûkna lamah an chho ta thung a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuela chu a thi a, Israel mi zawng zawng chu amah sûn tûrin an lo kal khâwm a. Rama khuaa a in kiangah chuan an phûm a. Tin, Davida chu a tho va, Paran thlalêrah chuan a chhuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maon khuaah chuan mi pakhat a awm a, Karmel-ah ram a nei a, a hausa hle a ni. Kêl sângkhat leh berâm sângthum a nei a, Karmel tlângah chuan a berâm hmulte chu a mêt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu pa hming chu Nabala a ni a, a nupui hming chu Abigaili a ni. Chu hmeichhia chu a felin a hmêl a ṭha hle a, a pasal erawh chu mi kawm tak leh thinbutut nei a ni. Ani chu Kaleba thlah a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutah chuan Nabalan berâm hmul a mêt tih Davida chuan thlalêr aṭangin a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Davida chuan a hnênah tlangvâl sâwm a tîr a, a mi tirhte hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Karmel tlânga Nabala hnênah chho ula, ka hmingin chibai bûk ang che u. ‘I chungah te, in chhûngkaw chungah te, i neih zawng zawng chungah te thlamuanna awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />He laiah berâm hmul i mêt tih ka lo hria a, i berâmpute pawh kan zîngah an khawsa ṭhîn a, an pawi eng mah kan khawih ngai lo, Karmel tlânga an awm chhûngin an thil eng mah a bo ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I hote zâwt la, an hrilh thei ang che. Chuvângin, ka hote hi lo khawngaih la, hei in ruai ṭheh ni takin an lo kal hi, i neih ang ang, i chhiahhlawhte leh i fapa Davida hi lo pe tûrin ka ngên a che,’ va ti rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Davida hote chu an kal a, chûng thu zawng zawng chu Davida hmingin an sawi a; tichuan, an nghâk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Davida hote chu Nabala chuan a chhâng ta a, “Davida chu tu nge maw ni le: Jesaia fapa chu tu nge ni? Tûnlai hian chhiahhlawh pute tlân bosan an tam mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka chaw te, ka tui te, ka berâm hmul mêttu te tâna ka talh sa te hi tute nge maw an nih pawh ka hriat hleih loh hnênah ka pe tehlul ang maw” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Davida tirh tlangvâlte chu an lo kîr leh a, chûng thu zawng zawng chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Davida chuan a mite hnênah, “Khandaih pai ṭheuh rawh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, khandaih an pai ta sang sang a, Davida pawh chuan a khandaih a pai a, mi zali laiin an zui chho va, mi zahnih chu bungraw vêngin an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chhiahhlawh pakhatin Nabala nupui Abigaili hnênah, “Ngai teh, Davida chuan thlalêr aṭangin kan pu chibai bûk tûrin mi a rawn tîr a, ani chuan a lo hau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng mite chu an ṭha hle a, kan pawi eng mah an khawih lo va, phûla kan awm ho chhûng zawng khân eng mah kan hloh ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Berâm vênga an bula kan awm chhûngin kan tân chhûn leh zânah kulh an ni ngawt mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tûnah, he thil hi engtin nge i tih dâwn ngaihtuah teh; chutilo chu kan pu chungah leh a chhûngkaw chungah thil ṭha lo a thleng mai ang e; kan pu lah hi a sual khawp a, thu hrilh theih pawh a ni si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Abigaili chuan hmanhmawh takin chhang tlang zahnih leh uain bûr hnih leh berâm panga, a hmin sa te, vaikan kg. sâwm leh pasarih leh grep pho ro bâwr te, theipui hlâwm zahnih nên a rawn la a, sabengtung a phurhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh tlangvâlte hnênah chuan, “Lo kal hmasa ula, ka rawn zui ang che u,” a ti a. A pasal Nabala erawh chu a hrilh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sabengtung chungah chuan a chuang a, a kal ta a. Leisekawt a thlen laiin Davida leh a hote chuan an rawn pan a, an intâwk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Davida chuan, “He pa thil neih zawng zawng hi pakhat mah bo lovin thlalêrah khân a thlâwnin ka lo vênsak a nih hi le, a chunga ka ṭhatna hi thil ṭha lovin min rûl ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khawvâr hmaa an zînga mipa naupang pakhat tê pawh ka zuah chuan Pathianin a tih tihin, na tak pawhin min ti rawh se,” a ti rilru a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abigaili chuan Davida a hmuh veleh a sabengtung aṭangin a chhuk a, Davida chu bawkkhupin chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A ke bulah a kûn a, a hnênah, “Ka pu, keima thiam loh vâng chauh a ni e, a mawh chu ka phur ang. I chhiahhlawhnuin i hnêna ka ngen hi khawngaih takin min ngaihthlâksak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka pu, he mi sualpa thu hi ngaimawh suh, a hming Nabala a ni ang ngei hian mi â a nih hi, â takin thil a ti ṭhîn a ni, kei i chhiahhlawhnu hian ka pu mi tirhte ka lo hmu lo atin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tûnah ka pu, Lalpa mi nung leh i hming chhâlin ka sawi e, “Thisen chhuah lo tûr leh phuba la lo tûrin Lalpa chuan a vêng che a, i hmêlma, i ṭhat lohna zawngtute chu Nabala ang hian awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, hei ka pu, i chhiahhlawhnuin i tân thilpêk ka rawn ken hi i ṭhuihruai tlangvâlte hian min dawnsak sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />i chhiahhlawhnu sualna hi khawngaih takin ngaidam ang che. Lalpa chuan ka pu lalna chu tinghet sela; ka pu hi Lalpa tâna do i ni si a, i dam chhûngin thil ṭha lo i tih hmuh tûr awm suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Miten tihhlum tumin ûm che mah sela, ka pu nunna chu Lalpa i Pathian chuan vênghim tlat sela, i hmêlmate nunna erawh chu lungtê an perh bo daih ang hi ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Israel-te hruaitu atân a ruat tawh si che a, Lalpa chuan i tâna thil ṭha a lo tiam tawh zawng zawng chu thlentîr rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chhan awm lova thisen i chhuah ngai loh leh phuba i lâk ngai loh hi, ka pu, i inchhîr rêng rêng lo vang. Lalpan ka pu hi a tihhlawhtlin hunah i chhiahhlawhnu hi min hre reng ang che aw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Davida chuan Abigaili hnênah, “Vawiina mi lo hmuak tûra tîrtu che Israel-te Pathian Lalpa chu fakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />I remhriatna avângin duhsakna dawng ang che, thisen chhuah sualna lak ata min vên avâng leh phuba la lo tûra vawiina ka kut i chelh avâng hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tina lo tûr che ua min khaptu Israel-te Pathian Lalpa , mi nung hmingin ka sawi e. Nang chuan mi lo hmuak lo la chu Nabala leh a mite chu tu mah zuah lovin naktûk zîng khaw ên hmain thah vek ka lo tum asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Davida chuan a thil rawn ken chu a lo dawnsak a, “Thlamuang takin haw rawh, i dîl chu ka hria e, i duh ang chuan ka tihsak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Abigaili chu Nabala hnênah chuan a hâwng ta a, inah chuan ruai ropui tak an lo ṭheh a, Nabala chu a rui hle a, a lo ṭawng lûng lûng a. chuvângin, a tûk khawvâr hma chuan a hnênah eng mah a sawi lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Nabala pawh a rui tawh lo va, a nupui chuan thil awmzia zawng zawng chu a han hrilh chuan a mit sulh a, a che thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ni sâwm hnuah Nabala chu Lalpa kut tuarin a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nabala thih thu Davidan a lo hriat chuan, “Nabalan min hmuhsitna phuba min lâksak a, thil sual ti lo tûra a chhiahhlawh min vêngtu Lalpa chu fakin awm sela, Lalpa chuan Nabala chu a thil tihdik loh avângin a tuartîr a nih hi,” a ti a. Davida chuan Abigaili chu a nupui atâna va be tûrin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Davida chhiahhlawhte chu Karmel tlângah Abigaili hnênah chuan an va kal a, a hnênah, “Davida chuan a nupui atân hruai tûr chein min tîr a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tichuan, Abigaili chu a tho va, bawkkhupin chibai a bûk a, “Ngai teh, i chhiahhlawhnu hi ka pu chhiahhlawhte ke sil tûr pawhin ka inpeih e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A tho thuai a, sabengtung chungah a chuang a, a tirhkah nula panga nên chuan Davida mi tirhte chu an zui a; tichuan, a nupuiah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Davida chuan Jezreel mi, Ahinoami a lo nei tawh bawk a, an pahnih chuan nupuiah a nei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Saula khân a fanu Mikali, Davida nupui kha, Galim khaw mi Laisa fapa Paltia a lo neihtîr tawh reng a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zif-ho chu Gibea khuaa Saula hnênah an lo kal a, “Davida chu Jesimon thlalêr bul Hakila tlângah a biru,” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Saula chu Israel mi zathum thlan chhuah hruaiin thlalêr lamah chuan Davida zawng tûrin a chhuk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saula chuan Jesimon thlalêr bul Hakila tlâng kawng sîrah riahhmun a khuar a; Davida erawh chu thlalêrah a awm a, Saulan a rawn zawng a ni tih a hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Enthlatu a tîr a, Saulan a rawn zawng ngei tih a hre chiang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Davida chu a tho va, Saula riahhmun khuarnaah chuan a va kal a; Saula leh a sipai hotu Abnera, Nera fapa mut hmun chu a va hria a. Saula chu an riahhmun lai takah a mu a, a vêlin a sipaite an mu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Davida chuan Hit mi Ahimeleka leh Joaba u, Zeruii fapa Abisaia hnênah, “Saula awmnaah tu zâwkin nge mi zui dâwn?” a ti a. Abisaia chuan, “Keiman ka zui ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Davida leh Abisaia chu zânah sipai awmnaah chuan an kal a, Saula chu an riahhmun lai takah chuan a mu a, a lu bulah a fei a vit bûr a, Abnera leh a sipaite chuan an lo mut hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abisaia chuan Davida hnênah, “Hei le, Pathianin i kutah i hmêlma hi a pe ta che a nih hi, khawi nge fei hian leiah ka han chhun bet tlat ang e, nawn leh a ngai tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Davida chuan Abisaia hnênah, “That suh, Lalpa hriakthih chunga kutthlâk tu nge thiam chang awm ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Davida vêk chuan, “ Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, Lalpan a chungah kutthlâk zâwk sela; a nih loh leh a thih ni a lo thleng emaw, indonaah a la boral mai emaw a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa hriakthih chungah hian kut ka thlâk tawp lo vang, a lu bula fei leh a tuithâwl erawh hi chu la ila, i kal ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chuan Saula lu bula fei leh tuithâwl chu a la a, an kalsan ta a. Tu man an hmu lo va, an hre hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Davida chu râl lehlamah a kal a, tlângchhîpah a ding a, an inkâr chu hla tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Davida chuan sipaiho leh Abnera chu a au va, “Abner, mi han chhâng dâwn na nge?” a ti a. Abnera chuan a chhâng a, “Lal han au veitu chu tu nge maw i nih le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Davida chuan Abnera hnênah, “Mipa i ni na nge? Israel zîngah tu nge nang tluk awm? Engati nge lal, i pu chu i vên ṭhat loh? I pu that tûrin mi an lo luh kha le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I tih dân hi a ṭha lo, Lalpa , mi nung chhâlin ka hrilh a che, Lalpa hriakthih i vên ṭhat loh avângin thi tlâk i ni, lal fei leh a tuithâwl, a lu bula mi kha khawiah nge a awm tâk?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saula chuan Davida aw a ni tih a hria a, “Ka fapa David, nang i ni maw?” a ti a. Davida chuan, “Ni e, lalber, ka pu, keimah ka ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Eng vângin nge ka pu hian a chhiahhlawh hi a ûm le? Eng thil nge ka tiha, eng nge ka tihsual?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal, ka pu chuan, a chhiahhlawh thu hi lo ngaithla teh se. Min bei tûra tithinurtu che hi Lalpa a nih chuan ka inpe mai tûr alâwm; mihring an nih erawh chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se. Chûng mite chuan kan ram Judai ram ata hi min ûmchhuaka, ‘Kal la, pathian dang rawng va bâwl rawh’ min ti a ni ngawt mai alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa awm lohna ramah chuan min that suh se; miin tlânga varung an veh ṭhîn ang hian Israel lal chuan kei uihli mai hi min rawn veh a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saula chuan, “Thil ka lo tisual a ni, ka fapa David, lo hâwng leh rawh. Vawiinah ka nun i zuah avângin i chungah kutthlâk ka tum leh tawh ngai lo vang. Â takin ka lo ûm che a, ka lo tidik lo a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Aw Lalpa , heta hi i fei a awm e, i mite zînga pakhat lo kal sela han la rawh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mi tin an fel leh rinawm man a pe dâwn si a. Vawiinah nang hi Lalpan ka kutah min pe a, Lalpa hriakthih chungah kut ka thlâk duh lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Vawiina i nunna ka zuah ang bawk hian Lalpa chuan ka nunna min zuahsak sela, buaina lak ata hi min chhan chhuak rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saula chuan Davida hnênah, “Ka fapa David, lo hmuingîl zêl la, i thil tih apiangah hlawhtling zêl ang che,” a ti a. Davida chu a kal ta a, Saula pawh a hmun lamah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida chu hetiang hian a inngaihtuah a, “Engtikah emaw chuan Saula hian min that ngei dâwn zawng a nih hi, Filistia rama tlan bo aia ṭha hi ka tân a awm dâwn lo a ni; tichuan, Saulan Israel ram chhûngah min zawn a beidawng ang a, a kut ata ka him thei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A insiam a, amah leh a ho mi zaruk chu Gath lal Maoka fapa Akisa hnênah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Davida chu Gath khuaa Akisa hnênah chuan a mite, an chhûngkua ṭheuh nên, a nupui pahnih Jezreel mi Ahinoami leh Karmel tlânga awm Nabala thihsan Abigaili te nên chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Davida chu Gath khuaah a tlân tih Saula an hrilh a; tichuan, a zawng zui ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Davida chuan Akisa hnênah, “Min khawngaih la, i rama khaw pakhat min pe la; tah chuan, kan lo awm ang e: engah nge lal khuaah hian i kiangah kan awm ve reng ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Akisa chuan Ziklag khua chu a pe a; tûn thlengin Ziklag khua chu Juda lalten an chang hlen ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Filistia rama Davida a awm chhûng chu kum khat leh thla li a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Davida leh a mite chu Gesur mite, Girzi mite, Amalek mite beiin an thawk chhuak ṭhîn a, chûng hnamte chu hmânlai ata tawh Sur ram leh Aigupta ram thlenga lo awm ṭhîn an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Davida chuan chûng ram chu a beih châng apiangin a hmei a pain a that vek ṭhîn a, an berâm te, an bâwng te, an sabengtung te, an sanghâwngsei te, an silhfen te nên a lâksak a. Akisa hnênah a rawn hâwn ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Akisa chuan, “Vawiinah tu nge i va rûn le?” a lo ti a. Davida chuan, “Judai ram chhim lam te, Israel-ho chênna chhim ram te, Kanan-ho chênna chhim ram te ka va rûn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Davida chuan a hmei a pain tu mah a zuah ngai lo va; a chhan chu, ‘Davida chu hetiangin a che ṭhîn,’ tiin kan chanchin an sawi dah ang e,” a ti a ni. Chu chu Filistia rama a awm chhûnga a tih dân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Akisa chuan Davida thu sawi chu a awih hle a, “A mi Israel-te huatah a insiam ta si a; chuvângin, kan thuhnuaiah an awm reng tawh dâwn a nih hi,” a tih phah a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Filistia mite chuan Israel-te do tûrin an sipai an khâwm chiam a, Akisa chuan Davida hnênah, “Nang leh i mite chuan ka sipaite in dopui ngei ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Dopui e, i chhiahhlawh hian eng nge ka tih ṭhin i hre mai ang,” a ti a. Akisa chuan Davida hnênah, “A ṭhat chu! Mi vêngtu atân i awm kumkhua mai dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samuela chu a thi a, Israel mi zawng zawngin an ṭah a; a chênna khua Rama-ah chuan an phûm tawh a. Saula chuan aienthiam te, dawithiam te a ram ata a hnawt chhuak vek tawh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Filistia mite chu an pung khâwm a, Sunem-ah ṭanhmun an khuar a. Saula chuan Israel mi zawng zawng a khâwm a, Gilboa khuaah ṭanhmun a khuar bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Saulan Filistia sipaiho a hmuh chuan a hlau va, a zâm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa a râwn a, Lalpa chuan mumangin emaw, Urim-in emaw, zâwlnei emaw pawhin a chhâng rêng rêng lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saula chuan a ṭhuihruaite hnênah, “Ka va râwn tûr mitthi thlûk thiam hmeichhia min zawnsak rawh u,” a ti a. Anni chuan, “E tak a, mitthi thlûk thiam hmeichhia pakhat chu Endor khuaah a awm asin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Saula chu a inbâwl danglam a, thawmhnaw dang a inbel a, mi pahnih hruaiin hmeichhe hnênah chuan zânah an va kal a, a hnênah, “Thlarau min râwnsak la, a hming ka lam chu min koh chhuahsak teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan a hnênah, “Ngai teh, Saula thiltihte chu i hria a, engati nge ka thihna tûrin ka tân thang i kam le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saula chuan, “ Lalpa hmingin ka tiam e, Lalpa mi nung chhâlin he thil avâng hian i thi lo vang tih ka tiam a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan, “Tu nge ka koh chhuahsak ang che?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Samuela mi koh chhuahsak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan Samuela a han hmuh chuan a ṭê ṭhawt a, Saula hnênah, “Engati nge Saula ni reng si-a mi bum?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal chuan hmeichhe hnênah chuan, “Hlau suh, eng nge i hmuh le?” a ti a. Hmeichhia chuan Saula hnênah, “Lei ata Pathian ni âwm tak lo chhuak ka hmu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Eng ang nge a nih?” a ti a. Hmeichhia chuan, “Putar a ni, kawrfual a ha,” a ti a. Saula chuan Samuela a ni tih a hre ta a, bawkkhupin chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuela chuan Saula hnênah, “Engati nge min koh chhuaha, mi tihbuai le?” a ti a. Saula chuan, “Ka mang a ang êm êm a, Filistia miten min rawn bei a, Pathian lah chuan min hawisan ta si a; zâwlnei emaw, mumang emaw pawhin min chhâng ta si lo va; chuvângin, ka tih tûr min hrilh tûrin ka ko ta che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samuela chuan, “Chutia Pathianin a hawisan chea, a hmêlma i nih tawh si chuan engtizia nge kei mi la rawn koh cheu va?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpan ka hnêna a sawi tawh ang khân i chungah a ti a nih chu, Lalpa chuan i lalna a chhuhsak che a, i lam hnai a pe tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa thu i zâwm lo va, Amalek-ho kha i tihchimih vek loh avângin tûnah he thil hi i chungah a lo thleng ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa chuan nang leh Israel-te chu Filistia mite kutah a pe che u ang a, naktûkah, nang leh i fate chuan min rawn zui ve ang a, Lalpa chuan Israel sipaite chu Filistia mite kutah a pe ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chu veleh Saula chu leiah a tlu a, Samuela thu sawi avâng chuan a hlau ta êm êm a, nilêng leh zankhuaa chaw ei lo a nih avângin a chau hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hmeichhia chu Saula hnênah a lo kal a, a mangang hle tih a hria a, a hnênah, “En teh, i chhiahhlawhnu hian i thu ka zâwm a, thih leh thih tiin mi hrilh angin ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tûnah, i chhiahhlawhnu thu awih ve la, ei tûr ka siam ang che a, chu chu ei la, i lo harh ang a, i hâwng thei mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ka ei dawn lo,” tiin a hnial a. A ṭhuihruaite chuan hmeichhe sawi ang chuan ei tûrin an tur a, an thu chu a zâwm ta a; tichuan, lei ata a lo tho va, khumah chuan a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan inah bâwngno chawm thau a nei a, a va talh sawk sawk a, chhangphut a la a, a hmet a, dawidim tel lovin chhang a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saula leh a ṭhuihruaite hmaah chuan a hlui a, an ei ta a. Tichuan, an tho va, chumi zân chuan an kal chhuak leh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistia mite chuan an sipai zawng zawng chu Afek-ah an ko khâwm a. Israel-te chuan Jezreel ruam tuikhur bulah ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Filistia lalho chu za rual te, sâng rual tein an lo kal duah duah a, Davida leh a mite chuan Akisa hovin hnu an dâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Filistia sipai hotute chuan, “Hêng Hebrai-te hian hetah eng nge an tih ve?” an ti a. Akisa chuan Filistia sipai hotute hnênah chuan, “He mi hi Israel lal Saula ṭhuihruai Davida a nih hi, kum khat zet ka hnênah a awm tawh a, ka hnêna a lo tlûkluh ni ata tûn thlengin a dik lohna rêng rêng ka hmu lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Filistia sipai hotute chu Akisa chungah an thinur hle a, a hnênah, “Ani chu i khaw pêkah chuan hâwntîr rawh, indonaah kan zîngah a chhuk ve tûr a ni lo, kan hmêlmate lama ṭangin kan mite lu a la ang a, a pu nên an inrem leh hlauh si ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />He Davida hi a ni lâwm ni lâm chunga: ‘Saulan sâng tam tak a that a, Davidan sîng tam tak a that,’ tia hlaa an awih kha?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Akisa chuan Davida chu a ko va, a hnênah, “ Lalpa hmingin ka sawi e, mi rinawm tak i ni a, kei chuan indonaah kan hnêna kal ve atân ka duh hle che a; ka hnên i lo thlen ni ata vawiin thlengin i dik lohna ka hmu rêng rêng lo; mahse, lalhote hian an duh lo che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, Filistia lal dangte hi i tihlungawi si loh chuan kîr leh ta mai la, lungawi takin kal ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Davida chuan Akisa hnênah, “Eng nge ka tihsual? I hnêna ka lo thlen ni ata vawiin thlengin thil fel lo eng nge i chhiahhlawh chungah i hmuh? Ka pu, lal hmêlma dopui tûra ka kal theih loh chhan hi eng nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Akisa chuan Davida chu heti hian a chhâng a, “Pathian vântirhkoh ang maiin ka mit hmuhah i fel a; nimahsela, Filistia lal dangte hian: ‘Indonaah kan zîngah a lo tel ve tûr a ni lo,’ an ti tlat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, zîng takah tho la, i hnêna i pu chhiahhlawhte nên hian naktûk zîngah, khua a ên veleh, chhuak vat rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida leh a mite chu Filistia rama kîr leh tûrin a tûk zîng takah chuan an tho va, Filistia mite erawh chu Jezreel-ah an chho ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni thum nia Davida leh a mite chuan Ziklag an va thlen chuan Amalek mite chuan chhim lam ram leh Ziklag khua chu an lo rûn a, Ziklag khua an lo la a, an hâl vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmeichhiate leh chu khuaa awm zawng zawng, naupang aṭanga tar thlengin salah an man a; tu mah that lovin an hruai a, an lo hâwnpui vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Davida leh a miten khua an va luh chuan a lo kâng chhe vek a, an nupui te, an fanu leh fapate chu salah an lo hruai vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Davida leh a mite chu nasa takin an ṭap a, chau hnêp khawpin an ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Davida nupui pahnih, Jezreel mi Ahinoami leh Karmel tlânga awm Nabala nupui thihsan Abigaili pawh salah an hruai bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An fanute leh an fapate sala an hruai avângin mite chu an thin a rim êm êm a, Davida chu den hlum an rawt a; chu thil avâng chuan Davida pawh a mangang hle a; mahse, Lalpa , a Pathian chuan a tichak thar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Davida chuan puithiam Abiathara, Ahimeleka fapa hnênah chuan, “Puithiam kawr kha han la teh,” a ti a. Abiathara chuan Davida hnênah puithiam kawr chu a rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Min rûntute chu ûm ila, ka la ûm pha ang em?” tiin Lalpa a râwn a. Ani chuan, “Ûm rawh, i ûm pha ang a, i chhan chhuak vek ang,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chu a hnêna mi zaruk awmte nên chuan an thawk chhuak ta a, Besor lui an va thleng a. Chutah chuan mi ṭhenkhat a hnutchhiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Davida chuan mi zali hruaiin a ûm zêl a, mi zahnih erawh kha chu an chauh lutuk avângin Besor lui chu an kai ve thei lo va, an hnutchhiah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Phûlah chuan Aigupta mi an va hmu a, Davida hnênah an rawn hruai a. Tui in tûr leh chaw ei tûr an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Theipui chhang hlâwm khat leh grep rah pho ro bâwr hnih an pe bawk a. Tin, chûng chu a han ei a, a lo harh ta a, ni thum leh zan thum lai ei leh in lovin a lo awm tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Davida chuan a hnênah, “Tu mi nge i niha, khawi aṭangin nge i lo kal?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Aigupta mi, Amalek-ho chhiahhlawh ka ni. Ni thum lai a ni ta, ka dam loh avângin ka puin min kalsan ta mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keret mite chênna ram chhim lam te, Judai ram chhim lam te, Kaleb-ho ram chhim lamte kan rûn a, Ziklag khua pawh kan bei bawk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Davida chuan a hnênah, “Chûng ram rûntute hnênah chuan min hruai thei ang em?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Min that lo tûr leh ka pu kuta min hlân lo tûra in Pathian hming chhâla thu min tiam chuan an hnênah ka hruai ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An hnênah chuan a zu hruai ta a, anni chuan Filistia ram leh Judai ram aṭanga an râllâk tam tak chu lâwmin ruai an lo ṭheh a, hmun tinah an lo awm darh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Davida chuan khawvâr tirh aṭangin a tûk tlai lam thlengin anni chu a bei a; tlangvâl zali, sabengtung chunga chuanga tlânchheho chauh lo chu tu mah dama chhuak reng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Davida chuan Amalek miten an lâksak zawng zawng chu a chhuh leh vek a, a nupui pahnih te pawh a chhan chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, naupang leh tar te, an fanu leh fapate leh an thil an lâksak tawh zawng zawng chu kim takin an la kîr leh vek a. Davida chuan a vaiin a hâwnpui leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Davida chuan berâm rual leh ran rual zawng zawng chu a la a, a mite hma lamah chuan an kaltîr a, “Hei hi Davida râllâk a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi zahnih, an chauh lutuk avânga Davida zui thei ta lo, Besor lui kama an hnutchhiah tâkte hnên chu Davida chuan a va thleng a. Anni chu Davida leh a hnêna kal vete hmuak tûrin an lo chhuak a, Davida leh a mite chuan an rawn pan a, anni chu chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Davida zuitute zînga mi sualho leh kawhmawh bâwl ṭhînte chuan, “Anni hi kan hnêna an kal ve loh avângin râllâk thil kan va lâkte chu kan pe ve lo vang, an nupui leh an fate erawh chu an hâwnpui thei ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Davida chuan a chhâng a, “Ka unaute u, chutiang chu a ni lo ve. Lalpa min pêk hi chutianga tih tûr a ni lo. Ani chuan min hum a, min beitute chu kan kutah min pe a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />He thilah hian tu nge in thu pawm thei ang le? Indonaa zuk kalte chan ang bawk bungraw vênga lo awmte hian an chang ve tûr a ni; inang vekin chan tûr a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Davida chuan Israel-te tân chutiang chuan dân leh thupêk a siam nghâl a, tûn thlengin an zâwm ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Davida chuan Ziklag khua a thlen chuan a râllâk sumte chu Judai ram hruaitu, a ṭhiante chu a sem ṭheuh va, “Hei, Lalpa hmêlmate laka râllâk ka rawn thawn che u a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, Bethel-a awm te, Rama chhima awm te, Jatira-a awm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aroer-a awm te, Sifmot-a awm te, Estamo-a awm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rakal-a awm te, Jerami-ho te, Ken-ho te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Horma-a awm te, Borasan-a awm te, Athak-a awm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hebron-a awmte leh Davida chettlat ṭhinna hmuna awm zawng zawng te pawh a thawn vek a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistia mite chuan Israel-hote chu an bei a; tichuan, Israel-te chu Filistia-ho lakah an tlânchhia a, mi tam tak Gilboa tlângah chuan an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saula leh a fate chu Filistia mite chuan an rawn nangchîng a, a fapa pathum Jonathana te, Abinadaba te, Malkisua te chu an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nasa lehzualin Saula chu an rawn bei a, thal kâptute chuan na takin an hliam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saula chuan a râlthuam kengtu hnênah, “I khandaih khân min han chhun tlang teh, chuti lo zawng, serh tan lohho an lo kal ang a, min rawn chhun ang a, nuihza siam nân min rawn hmang dah ang e,” a ti a. A râlthuam kengtu chuan a hlauh êm avângin chu chu a ti duh lo va; tichuan, Saula chuan a khandaih chu a la a, a bawh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A râlthuam kengtu chuan Saula a thi tih a hriat chuan a khandaih chu a bawh ve ta a, an thi dûn ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Saula te, a fapa pathum te, a râlthuam kengtu te leh a mite chu an za-in an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Phairuam râl lehlama Israel mite leh Jordan râla awmte chuan Israel sipaite an tlânchhia tih leh Saula leh a fapate an thi tih an hriat chuan an khua an chhuahsan a, an tlan bo va, Filistia mite chuan an luahsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Filistia mite chu an râlthuamte hlîp tûrin an va chhuak a, Saula leh a fa pathum, Gilboa tlânga thi chu an va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saula lu chu an tan a, râlthuam chu an hlîp a. Chu thu chu mi zawng zawng hrilh tûrin an milem biakna inah te, Filistia ram pumpuiah mi an tîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saula râlthuam chu Astoret biak inah an dah a, a ruang chu Beth-san kulh bangah an phuar bet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jabes-gilead miten Saula chunga Filistia mite thiltih chu an lo hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />mi huaisenho chu an lo thawk a, zankhuain Beth-san panin an kal a. Saula leh a fate ruang chu Beth-san kulh bang ata an la thla a, Jabes-ah an rawn la a; tichuan, an hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An ruhte chu an la a, Jabes hmuna Esel thing hnuaiah an phûm a, ni sarih chaw an nghei a.
  </para>
</usx>
